(3417, 1, '2019-09-13 16:50:52', '2019-09-13 08:50:52', '洪益芬  總會長', '日本台灣商會聯合總會', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'tong-hoi-2', '', '', '2025-08-04 12:20:27', '2025-08-04 04:20:27', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?post_type=chamber&#038;p=3417', 0, 'chamber', '', 0),
(3443, 1, '2019-09-16 16:23:46', '2019-09-16 08:23:46', '<p>【 ASTCC+WTCC<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌍</span></span>世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團 】</p>\r\n<p>2019-7-23至24日，本總會 總會長 賴維信、輔導總會長 邱文潛伉儷、名譽總會長 施至隆、名譽總會長 李天柒，受邀參加「WTCC <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌐</span></span> 世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團」。</p>\r\n<p>7月23日晉見總統府蔡英文總統；並拜會外交部吳釗燮部長、外貿協會黃志芳董事長。下午赴桃園參訪「桃園市虎頭山創新園區」與國內智能科技、物聯網相關產業廠商進行交流，晚宴由 桃園市鄭文燦市長及市府團隊設宴招待。<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3360\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67402385_2368732830061917_8365124201157230592_n-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />   <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3361\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67204420_2367296033538930_5854625051101364224_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>\r\n<div class=\"text_exposed_show\">\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 總統府新聞 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><br />\r\n 總統 蔡英文於7月23日，特別接見「世界台商回國訪問暨投資考察團」。蔡英文：台商回流已突破4520億 感謝台商拚外交<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommunity/article/article_story.jsp?id=247469&amp;fbclid=IwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ocacnews.net%2Foverseascommunity%2Farticle%2Farticle_story.jsp%3Fid%3D247469%26fbclid%3DIwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0&amp;h=AT1X5vXwdWKyqmqriZTQ7S7osZnWUuKOL-wnC0lM_3SMXGTGr8_Kjku7Wc8ZGG18jpobsRxD3h79fIPIFNoYWtOFHqOvJcn3Wb1Kg0FjchFB4PWhX-a972fugwQs8QxhYFS3TZxG9eIwYRN1I3rDH4Gf3sCSIMFq1pN3-LjXD73aPEFRPKjw6V0TLF3iorhjPqJnGd-Rm5RQs1wudhJjcKfL_jqNs0lOE75jR81pVNLB9ViPHHPzDhp6LhHwP-eZR_CgtsMrZeD8ajxY1eoissAiIVI4T6reiJnAPL4ZjdlGhsWCNc92o7TjKKDLA-Z6pmvLiW1uptCZniP8DdmbI1r22dxWClVmNsc9TpKTuyarrrhyMYxNPzSavJGqVxNxEGCaGZiu2j_PEMjxeNjajSYJPechKvgOMDPiwezqTlHuMdUdrdFYfx23XYhyTbVhzexwl_Aal8O4KY3EdxE-agMmi8L2pm7_ONQmDxvfCmvTRzhhRsQvBQ41Jd0iBXWbr45LgORyA1ivRsYPFy6YfusXxCngs-_6cVworGfxEWpkn4n5zfJVbupdaoaT6ppzeVIBM2UZ8QgCc7MuIS9adYD1Amy9WhJfhD23CSirnKKG7FtstBnaf_Blo17cIE0zmpX-yhrFULc\">https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommu…/…/article_story.jsp…</a></p>\r\n<p>7月24日。本團赴台中拜訪國防產業代表：台中市漢翔航空以及生技醫療產業代表：金可集團該集團轄下有；金可眼鏡、海昌隱形眼鏡、永勝光學等關係企業。該晚由 金可集團 蔡國洲董事長及團隊設宴招待全體團員。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 漢翔航空工業 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✈️</span></span></p>\r\n<p>漢翔航空工業股份有限公司（簡稱漢翔公司、漢翔航空）是中華民國的航空器製造商。前身為1946年成立的空軍航空工業局，1996年7月1日改組成漢翔公司，2014年8月後改為民營企業。與國家中山科學研究院合作密切，同時與國立彰化師範大學簽訂有策略聯盟協議，師資亦與鄰近之台中市嘉陽高中飛機修護科有業師結合。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aidc.com.tw%2Ftw%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3Hq73n2RqxdgZxUoTGMGrWlnX84amUf91DQloRX4EbG4bbYMiuBTyo2cY&amp;h=AT2X7wmgYCnRfcxL_5A-EzY1JthgXs9rnCVAhqiKHNga6yuDC3zGg2Zr3eGIyIpGLu8nxNsH_JLs0EVtM1mwdbKkkXzwvNp2KSx-MZhhX0VpmOoFtFRWkVX42GT6ttNzannyy_bXmsk1FUkaf0Ln3wQTVNkYjfXGY7Ye4ZHpOPCvS1rWaMGy7Fo5kMB_9AFsZ4XKLiuhrNrDAQlKN_ubIc02xumsNiEKeEoBK7mICCV6LNLxA5_I5DciyRrdGwQSY-JkLngSKb0AIDsfZuDr_uPq9L8nvufULZxi0ZwNDU9g2LKBKARLDgedfW1XkKox6pn08h1K6RXl3ydqNLRM7rBEircs2p-GtstNYAosqwzjILB0g_ihVUcDTOnLnvM3VUcdS660VKqq8UYauFTz4BqrSfrI8ybAMSH-40OMy1EN3ADQeSnG-_3rcQ2YCIPRKs-0UcDQduC3wvcqROJu41UsEuUU9dzSZaDSaRt0L7vUiPaH8jI02liLuUr5BY9DTZLhh7N6B0hVOcJ0mnUCUYgIi0vzuEzUsbJAx91s5HEzLzJhp3cUKu0CGdWqQBQSEHBip-Hz1thdx2vu2ktoacdpcpI31pRiU6Sog048LjJCT4ylq_tJECyvLXxEP1IcC18slpHYmGo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\">https://www.aidc.com.tw/tw/<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3362\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67239248_2368733186728548_85409139827671040_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /><br />\r\n </a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 金可集團 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">👓</span></span></p>\r\n<p>金可集團事業群涵蓋品牌眼鏡、策略投資、隱形眼鏡、醫藥生化與眼鏡通路五大事業群，<br />\r\n 5大事業群行銷版圖橫跨歐亞，涵蓋台灣、日本、馬來西亞、中國大陸、美國等地。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php?fbclid=IwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek#_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ginkointernational.com.tw%2Findex_tw.php%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek%23_&amp;h=AT3Z5HO8YkDRCG2KTqcxIB_F1S2PbBuQGVWWprnWudUosxNIJe01r2ebaJr0r53jFpnsyq8W7GuPG_XPN7TGWZGd4QxCueiN_UFHLLvRmouI4w071AWjVZsiu0Lp9L2yxgiuRXSAcPmAvN0H-4RUWyTCi0UvOsJaBovDTjO5yC8Xf1rVGOdw3oxvXF0ve7bQiGz8VGLMDFuIh4t0SbN7F3r5_rW_o6PJ694g6OaIbPOyqLrI59fyIVXVYQj2x676MEkd_5-M5S7uEt115zmLBa9yr03ssBFz8v2Y_GIrsvEa1GuKj0I_lUNOz4NDqPT9GdHaJGKUVI9K7_CLvlTK-lRr8E_pvSwg5WcOLXQU-rBEYGy_Eajxgd7Z_H86QLuIFb7sZgosrgDBdzsd_BFKN6UyZP1GuZQ6yRhrQwHhBBPnpyjiImmFTGuwEpPce-R24sKNrykXFVvSRsHf6oz__DweiNa_3IscZ46ICIJyYtqU36pQHIt_hCgk6oSP_hXd1sXNV2h447BT_tf0ZDAtqRYeLgvPvlJFp6MZw9UJYwamJnRbjzh51OGxDGElJRB615M_0uGiYEz0dCK3S1fUjwPstorVvE6aNEcV5zPBtNrtqgKnO0henjUAouOPUZvMSpwBLfHwiE8tpaZm6A\">https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php#_</a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 桃園虎頭山創新園區 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🐯</span></span></p>\r\n<p>桃園是全臺第一的工業科技大城，工業產值連續14年全國第一。除了坐擁航空及汽車零組件等多元而完整的產業聚落，更臨近機場國門，讓桃園市政府配合中央亞洲・矽谷計畫規劃的「虎頭山創新園區」，從一開始籌備就備受注目。</p>\r\n<p>甫於6月18日正式開幕的虎頭山創新園區第一期，是全臺首座結合「車聯智駕中心」與「資安物聯網中心」的測試研發基地。總統蔡英文親自出席開幕典禮，提出「臺灣產業發展的未來在人工智慧結合物聯網（AIOT），而AIOT的未來在桃園」。桃園市長鄭文燦表示，虎頭山創新園區是「亞洲・矽谷計畫」的亮點之一，要建構臺灣車用電子與物聯網的實際研發與驗證場域，搶先布局打入國際。</p>\r\n<p>相關新聞：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829&amp;fbclid=IwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fcity.gvm.com.tw%2Farticle.html%3Fid%3D66829%26fbclid%3DIwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104&amp;h=AT2VCTCzMchJ8oxAXQIniG8HmKO-R4zXGu-NE0KMtpJdDzT7Z32d25MyPpp12vgbwVFWPi3M7n6SKMXsrcO4wXq8SXI2ndC5ulMpBcGJa1rfNOy0Z_21q86oXcLDZzToDOeUH9UfgC47_HmSJMVFBgTh7NRYJgXo1UWu_MkBDv-ltAtaPNc2u_Zs1TLBaVmUByAek-f-dp1WZ5TO2cvu9pIMn1_i-6wCVTXGbkDRC2GptRxKDktld6DA1FIMnF8anbYK5TnjOdg6Q9H1S79oyBdBY9z2lH83Aqtz2eLkePHMnZqFuEjS3oUPLCRCsT_FRSSLg0Ui42KgbD690DSRlUbALCFh3tQvvcPNPwFWhcNOYHE6lp7kSh9wWlFtsoXC0sU8iC1Yjkw9blnGXPCs2vaBeIhe1icF68CzJQBpR9n3MCpCufZLBWe8NUcPOpSFvGPiLVgGOqWHCFuL8VYP1_vIXRE3FIispCZ4AtAkW6Llpj-zSslbv5HzYeX0INwnSvEuzHbxusYfCZ0T_Ht9QuDpCVvAERwY2osL37U7Gt7zGvHSjwJ5ggyhoWhDWI8dk8fTlzF1PqRFV2YPBzrIpHkENTrAEnw5LtiX118K2H5P1j3SHrhS1DFvYypQGDnMWN7R0eFy41M\">https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829</a></p>\r\n</div>', 'ASTCC+WTCC🌍世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3357-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-09-16 16:23:46', '2019-09-16 08:23:46', '', 3357, 'http://localhost/astcc/3357-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3448, 1, '2019-09-16 17:25:06', '2019-09-16 09:25:06', '<p>【 ASTCC+WTCC<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌍</span></span>世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團 】</p>\r\n<p>2019-7-23至24日，本總會 總會長 賴維信、輔導總會長 邱文潛伉儷、名譽總會長 施至隆、名譽總會長 李天柒，受邀參加「WTCC <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌐</span></span> 世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團」。<br />\r\n<!--more--></p>\r\n<p>7月23日晉見總統府蔡英文總統；並拜會外交部吳釗燮部長、外貿協會黃志芳董事長。下午赴桃園參訪「桃園市虎頭山創新園區」與國內智能科技、物聯網相關產業廠商進行交流，晚宴由 桃園市鄭文燦市長及市府團隊設宴招待。<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3360\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67402385_2368732830061917_8365124201157230592_n-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />   <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3361\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67204420_2367296033538930_5854625051101364224_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>\r\n<div class=\"text_exposed_show\">\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 總統府新聞 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><br />\r\n 總統 蔡英文於7月23日，特別接見「世界台商回國訪問暨投資考察團」。蔡英文：台商回流已突破4520億 感謝台商拚外交<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommunity/article/article_story.jsp?id=247469&amp;fbclid=IwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ocacnews.net%2Foverseascommunity%2Farticle%2Farticle_story.jsp%3Fid%3D247469%26fbclid%3DIwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0&amp;h=AT1X5vXwdWKyqmqriZTQ7S7osZnWUuKOL-wnC0lM_3SMXGTGr8_Kjku7Wc8ZGG18jpobsRxD3h79fIPIFNoYWtOFHqOvJcn3Wb1Kg0FjchFB4PWhX-a972fugwQs8QxhYFS3TZxG9eIwYRN1I3rDH4Gf3sCSIMFq1pN3-LjXD73aPEFRPKjw6V0TLF3iorhjPqJnGd-Rm5RQs1wudhJjcKfL_jqNs0lOE75jR81pVNLB9ViPHHPzDhp6LhHwP-eZR_CgtsMrZeD8ajxY1eoissAiIVI4T6reiJnAPL4ZjdlGhsWCNc92o7TjKKDLA-Z6pmvLiW1uptCZniP8DdmbI1r22dxWClVmNsc9TpKTuyarrrhyMYxNPzSavJGqVxNxEGCaGZiu2j_PEMjxeNjajSYJPechKvgOMDPiwezqTlHuMdUdrdFYfx23XYhyTbVhzexwl_Aal8O4KY3EdxE-agMmi8L2pm7_ONQmDxvfCmvTRzhhRsQvBQ41Jd0iBXWbr45LgORyA1ivRsYPFy6YfusXxCngs-_6cVworGfxEWpkn4n5zfJVbupdaoaT6ppzeVIBM2UZ8QgCc7MuIS9adYD1Amy9WhJfhD23CSirnKKG7FtstBnaf_Blo17cIE0zmpX-yhrFULc\">https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommu…/…/article_story.jsp…</a></p>\r\n<p>7月24日。本團赴台中拜訪國防產業代表：台中市漢翔航空以及生技醫療產業代表：金可集團該集團轄下有；金可眼鏡、海昌隱形眼鏡、永勝光學等關係企業。該晚由 金可集團 蔡國洲董事長及團隊設宴招待全體團員。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 漢翔航空工業 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✈️</span></span></p>\r\n<p>漢翔航空工業股份有限公司（簡稱漢翔公司、漢翔航空）是中華民國的航空器製造商。前身為1946年成立的空軍航空工業局，1996年7月1日改組成漢翔公司，2014年8月後改為民營企業。與國家中山科學研究院合作密切，同時與國立彰化師範大學簽訂有策略聯盟協議，師資亦與鄰近之台中市嘉陽高中飛機修護科有業師結合。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aidc.com.tw%2Ftw%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3Hq73n2RqxdgZxUoTGMGrWlnX84amUf91DQloRX4EbG4bbYMiuBTyo2cY&amp;h=AT2X7wmgYCnRfcxL_5A-EzY1JthgXs9rnCVAhqiKHNga6yuDC3zGg2Zr3eGIyIpGLu8nxNsH_JLs0EVtM1mwdbKkkXzwvNp2KSx-MZhhX0VpmOoFtFRWkVX42GT6ttNzannyy_bXmsk1FUkaf0Ln3wQTVNkYjfXGY7Ye4ZHpOPCvS1rWaMGy7Fo5kMB_9AFsZ4XKLiuhrNrDAQlKN_ubIc02xumsNiEKeEoBK7mICCV6LNLxA5_I5DciyRrdGwQSY-JkLngSKb0AIDsfZuDr_uPq9L8nvufULZxi0ZwNDU9g2LKBKARLDgedfW1XkKox6pn08h1K6RXl3ydqNLRM7rBEircs2p-GtstNYAosqwzjILB0g_ihVUcDTOnLnvM3VUcdS660VKqq8UYauFTz4BqrSfrI8ybAMSH-40OMy1EN3ADQeSnG-_3rcQ2YCIPRKs-0UcDQduC3wvcqROJu41UsEuUU9dzSZaDSaRt0L7vUiPaH8jI02liLuUr5BY9DTZLhh7N6B0hVOcJ0mnUCUYgIi0vzuEzUsbJAx91s5HEzLzJhp3cUKu0CGdWqQBQSEHBip-Hz1thdx2vu2ktoacdpcpI31pRiU6Sog048LjJCT4ylq_tJECyvLXxEP1IcC18slpHYmGo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\">https://www.aidc.com.tw/tw/<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3362\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67239248_2368733186728548_85409139827671040_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /><br />\r\n </a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 金可集團 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">👓</span></span></p>\r\n<p>金可集團事業群涵蓋品牌眼鏡、策略投資、隱形眼鏡、醫藥生化與眼鏡通路五大事業群，<br />\r\n 5大事業群行銷版圖橫跨歐亞，涵蓋台灣、日本、馬來西亞、中國大陸、美國等地。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php?fbclid=IwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek#_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ginkointernational.com.tw%2Findex_tw.php%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek%23_&amp;h=AT3Z5HO8YkDRCG2KTqcxIB_F1S2PbBuQGVWWprnWudUosxNIJe01r2ebaJr0r53jFpnsyq8W7GuPG_XPN7TGWZGd4QxCueiN_UFHLLvRmouI4w071AWjVZsiu0Lp9L2yxgiuRXSAcPmAvN0H-4RUWyTCi0UvOsJaBovDTjO5yC8Xf1rVGOdw3oxvXF0ve7bQiGz8VGLMDFuIh4t0SbN7F3r5_rW_o6PJ694g6OaIbPOyqLrI59fyIVXVYQj2x676MEkd_5-M5S7uEt115zmLBa9yr03ssBFz8v2Y_GIrsvEa1GuKj0I_lUNOz4NDqPT9GdHaJGKUVI9K7_CLvlTK-lRr8E_pvSwg5WcOLXQU-rBEYGy_Eajxgd7Z_H86QLuIFb7sZgosrgDBdzsd_BFKN6UyZP1GuZQ6yRhrQwHhBBPnpyjiImmFTGuwEpPce-R24sKNrykXFVvSRsHf6oz__DweiNa_3IscZ46ICIJyYtqU36pQHIt_hCgk6oSP_hXd1sXNV2h447BT_tf0ZDAtqRYeLgvPvlJFp6MZw9UJYwamJnRbjzh51OGxDGElJRB615M_0uGiYEz0dCK3S1fUjwPstorVvE6aNEcV5zPBtNrtqgKnO0henjUAouOPUZvMSpwBLfHwiE8tpaZm6A\">https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php#_</a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 桃園虎頭山創新園區 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🐯</span></span></p>\r\n<p>桃園是全臺第一的工業科技大城，工業產值連續14年全國第一。除了坐擁航空及汽車零組件等多元而完整的產業聚落，更臨近機場國門，讓桃園市政府配合中央亞洲・矽谷計畫規劃的「虎頭山創新園區」，從一開始籌備就備受注目。</p>\r\n<p>甫於6月18日正式開幕的虎頭山創新園區第一期，是全臺首座結合「車聯智駕中心」與「資安物聯網中心」的測試研發基地。總統蔡英文親自出席開幕典禮，提出「臺灣產業發展的未來在人工智慧結合物聯網（AIOT），而AIOT的未來在桃園」。桃園市長鄭文燦表示，虎頭山創新園區是「亞洲・矽谷計畫」的亮點之一，要建構臺灣車用電子與物聯網的實際研發與驗證場域，搶先布局打入國際。</p>\r\n<p>相關新聞：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829&amp;fbclid=IwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fcity.gvm.com.tw%2Farticle.html%3Fid%3D66829%26fbclid%3DIwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104&amp;h=AT2VCTCzMchJ8oxAXQIniG8HmKO-R4zXGu-NE0KMtpJdDzT7Z32d25MyPpp12vgbwVFWPi3M7n6SKMXsrcO4wXq8SXI2ndC5ulMpBcGJa1rfNOy0Z_21q86oXcLDZzToDOeUH9UfgC47_HmSJMVFBgTh7NRYJgXo1UWu_MkBDv-ltAtaPNc2u_Zs1TLBaVmUByAek-f-dp1WZ5TO2cvu9pIMn1_i-6wCVTXGbkDRC2GptRxKDktld6DA1FIMnF8anbYK5TnjOdg6Q9H1S79oyBdBY9z2lH83Aqtz2eLkePHMnZqFuEjS3oUPLCRCsT_FRSSLg0Ui42KgbD690DSRlUbALCFh3tQvvcPNPwFWhcNOYHE6lp7kSh9wWlFtsoXC0sU8iC1Yjkw9blnGXPCs2vaBeIhe1icF68CzJQBpR9n3MCpCufZLBWe8NUcPOpSFvGPiLVgGOqWHCFuL8VYP1_vIXRE3FIispCZ4AtAkW6Llpj-zSslbv5HzYeX0INwnSvEuzHbxusYfCZ0T_Ht9QuDpCVvAERwY2osL37U7Gt7zGvHSjwJ5ggyhoWhDWI8dk8fTlzF1PqRFV2YPBzrIpHkENTrAEnw5LtiX118K2H5P1j3SHrhS1DFvYypQGDnMWN7R0eFy41M\">https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829</a></p>\r\n</div>', 'ASTCC+WTCC🌍世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3357-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-09-16 17:25:06', '2019-09-16 09:25:06', '', 3357, 'http://localhost/astcc/3357-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3449, 1, '2019-09-16 17:51:36', '2019-09-16 09:51:36', '<p>2019亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會-活動影片精彩回顧：</p>\r\n<p>亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會於7月16日假桃園桃禧航空城酒店舉行第8屆第3次理監事會及第9屆第1次理監事會，計有來自亞洲8個青商會員國代表及全球各地貴賓共襄盛舉。青商會於當日特別發表自創曲「亞青之歌-台灣少年郎」並搭配青商活動花絮錄製精美MV，充分展現海外青商源源不絕的創新力及衝勁十足的執行力!歡迎大家點選瀏覽!<!--more--><br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3370\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67663628_2398822620212168_2111690816484278272_n-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /><br />\r\n </p>\r\n<p>影片來源：亞洲台灣商會聯合總會青商會<span class=\"text_exposed_show\"><br />\r\n <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2FH06dVwahMbE%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3u4zdAQLx7Q75Uh66cjqzBnOW9m5TYKdBNa15KuKATcCsjklHHscqbxaM&amp;h=AT085zZvxaMCUne2tciDOxMHtImdYF8-IyRLjdFtma5R4iQ2inDJemGAcr9VHcmWAAV6l2XvfyWpskCmgunkxeJKWVT2Pl6dQXyNDrHCl5Kt6Dd38b5t4JegnQajmqj6c5CEYTV_sz1WLHVOeFn8RU8qrHZ3Ty0XS6HY1CXiNFwIeNE9qDFj9iDibMeFNP9QUsfIRmrXJT9xhWREqMjFNuky8MLH2vgnHO_NBooC8Cc3T86li069t2XfDxanJzYcPGyYHDkK6L7p4vrbwKfQW4My4n2FMPlMA29HqLRAiYkBbp6fB7AtrtDPcXVRf8zwuHj1YrtOAX05oAUq-qK-7TZsL-rirP1gnWl4e3y1EQ8EJOqIIJn5T2f8WEdPKsqfvQcxJmj6OcVPa2AdGecSvCs6UWav1WckFFJMWoH9bufDxmrfDOKqLaDiPU2uxrWeRzCfJjbpAN6UX6lnhengz__ZDGt_g_xl-NDopU6FnjDhv1tvnSgGlQzMhQ_5tJ1s0C65e5lBOFY5ITq9qjJ9o1_vEeLytJQs1MLp8CqV06iGKDn7lwRv4i8mdsYPK72RBWbnS4FxnayVUMSDY9gFmoqX1vmAb5uCZ4ykl6-su2Hs-kThsgIbraFnPbhQlbYdd1U23gs1EPyKslcMlfB74whbKh66DZp0WG141Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\">https://youtu.be/H06dVwahMbE<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3369\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67398349_2398723836888713_4171457522764349440_n-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" /><br />\r\n </a></span></p>', '2019亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會-活動影片精彩回顧', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3355-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-09-16 17:51:36', '2019-09-16 09:51:36', '', 3355, 'http://localhost/astcc/3355-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `astc_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(3454, 1, '2019-09-16 18:04:46', '2019-09-16 10:04:46', '<p>【 ASTCC+WTCC<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌍</span></span>世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團 】</p>\r\n<p>2019-7-23至24日，本總會 總會長 賴維信、輔導總會長 邱文潛伉儷、名譽總會長 施至隆、名譽總會長 李天柒，受邀參加「WTCC <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🌐</span></span> 世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團」。<br />\r\n <!--more--></p>\r\n<p>7月23日晉見總統府蔡英文總統；並拜會外交部吳釗燮部長、外貿協會黃志芳董事長。下午赴桃園參訪「桃園市虎頭山創新園區」與國內智能科技、物聯網相關產業廠商進行交流，晚宴由 桃園市鄭文燦市長及市府團隊設宴招待。<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3360\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67402385_2368732830061917_8365124201157230592_n-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />   <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3361\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67204420_2367296033538930_5854625051101364224_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>\r\n<div class=\"text_exposed_show\">\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 總統府新聞 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><br />\r\n 總統 蔡英文於7月23日，特別接見「世界台商回國訪問暨投資考察團」。蔡英文：台商回流已突破4520億 感謝台商拚外交<span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💵</span></span><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">💰</span></span><br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommunity/article/article_story.jsp?id=247469&amp;fbclid=IwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ocacnews.net%2Foverseascommunity%2Farticle%2Farticle_story.jsp%3Fid%3D247469%26fbclid%3DIwAR0RuWcdOEDwnGZvvyogk33NRU2a67Lk5hcYRPDpa6RJ-qsnj0h6tNDL5b0&amp;h=AT1X5vXwdWKyqmqriZTQ7S7osZnWUuKOL-wnC0lM_3SMXGTGr8_Kjku7Wc8ZGG18jpobsRxD3h79fIPIFNoYWtOFHqOvJcn3Wb1Kg0FjchFB4PWhX-a972fugwQs8QxhYFS3TZxG9eIwYRN1I3rDH4Gf3sCSIMFq1pN3-LjXD73aPEFRPKjw6V0TLF3iorhjPqJnGd-Rm5RQs1wudhJjcKfL_jqNs0lOE75jR81pVNLB9ViPHHPzDhp6LhHwP-eZR_CgtsMrZeD8ajxY1eoissAiIVI4T6reiJnAPL4ZjdlGhsWCNc92o7TjKKDLA-Z6pmvLiW1uptCZniP8DdmbI1r22dxWClVmNsc9TpKTuyarrrhyMYxNPzSavJGqVxNxEGCaGZiu2j_PEMjxeNjajSYJPechKvgOMDPiwezqTlHuMdUdrdFYfx23XYhyTbVhzexwl_Aal8O4KY3EdxE-agMmi8L2pm7_ONQmDxvfCmvTRzhhRsQvBQ41Jd0iBXWbr45LgORyA1ivRsYPFy6YfusXxCngs-_6cVworGfxEWpkn4n5zfJVbupdaoaT6ppzeVIBM2UZ8QgCc7MuIS9adYD1Amy9WhJfhD23CSirnKKG7FtstBnaf_Blo17cIE0zmpX-yhrFULc\">https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommu…/…/article_story.jsp…</a></p>\r\n<p>7月24日。本團赴台中拜訪國防產業代表：台中市漢翔航空以及生技醫療產業代表：金可集團該集團轄下有；金可眼鏡、海昌隱形眼鏡、永勝光學等關係企業。該晚由 金可集團 蔡國洲董事長及團隊設宴招待全體團員。</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 漢翔航空工業 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✈️</span></span></p>\r\n<p>漢翔航空工業股份有限公司（簡稱漢翔公司、漢翔航空）是中華民國的航空器製造商。前身為1946年成立的空軍航空工業局，1996年7月1日改組成漢翔公司，2014年8月後改為民營企業。與國家中山科學研究院合作密切，同時與國立彰化師範大學簽訂有策略聯盟協議，師資亦與鄰近之台中市嘉陽高中飛機修護科有業師結合。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aidc.com.tw%2Ftw%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3Hq73n2RqxdgZxUoTGMGrWlnX84amUf91DQloRX4EbG4bbYMiuBTyo2cY&amp;h=AT2X7wmgYCnRfcxL_5A-EzY1JthgXs9rnCVAhqiKHNga6yuDC3zGg2Zr3eGIyIpGLu8nxNsH_JLs0EVtM1mwdbKkkXzwvNp2KSx-MZhhX0VpmOoFtFRWkVX42GT6ttNzannyy_bXmsk1FUkaf0Ln3wQTVNkYjfXGY7Ye4ZHpOPCvS1rWaMGy7Fo5kMB_9AFsZ4XKLiuhrNrDAQlKN_ubIc02xumsNiEKeEoBK7mICCV6LNLxA5_I5DciyRrdGwQSY-JkLngSKb0AIDsfZuDr_uPq9L8nvufULZxi0ZwNDU9g2LKBKARLDgedfW1XkKox6pn08h1K6RXl3ydqNLRM7rBEircs2p-GtstNYAosqwzjILB0g_ihVUcDTOnLnvM3VUcdS660VKqq8UYauFTz4BqrSfrI8ybAMSH-40OMy1EN3ADQeSnG-_3rcQ2YCIPRKs-0UcDQduC3wvcqROJu41UsEuUU9dzSZaDSaRt0L7vUiPaH8jI02liLuUr5BY9DTZLhh7N6B0hVOcJ0mnUCUYgIi0vzuEzUsbJAx91s5HEzLzJhp3cUKu0CGdWqQBQSEHBip-Hz1thdx2vu2ktoacdpcpI31pRiU6Sog048LjJCT4ylq_tJECyvLXxEP1IcC18slpHYmGo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\">https://www.aidc.com.tw/tw/<br />\r\n <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3362\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67239248_2368733186728548_85409139827671040_n-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /><br />\r\n </a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 金可集團 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">👓</span></span></p>\r\n<p>金可集團事業群涵蓋品牌眼鏡、策略投資、隱形眼鏡、醫藥生化與眼鏡通路五大事業群，<br />\r\n 5大事業群行銷版圖橫跨歐亞，涵蓋台灣、日本、馬來西亞、中國大陸、美國等地。</p>\r\n<p>公司網址：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php?fbclid=IwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek#_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ginkointernational.com.tw%2Findex_tw.php%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0NxReBrpQfZJcmGqjTJA9n46awDgDbQOJcsN3LuGFPo2CVNM6AS13Ufek%23_&amp;h=AT3Z5HO8YkDRCG2KTqcxIB_F1S2PbBuQGVWWprnWudUosxNIJe01r2ebaJr0r53jFpnsyq8W7GuPG_XPN7TGWZGd4QxCueiN_UFHLLvRmouI4w071AWjVZsiu0Lp9L2yxgiuRXSAcPmAvN0H-4RUWyTCi0UvOsJaBovDTjO5yC8Xf1rVGOdw3oxvXF0ve7bQiGz8VGLMDFuIh4t0SbN7F3r5_rW_o6PJ694g6OaIbPOyqLrI59fyIVXVYQj2x676MEkd_5-M5S7uEt115zmLBa9yr03ssBFz8v2Y_GIrsvEa1GuKj0I_lUNOz4NDqPT9GdHaJGKUVI9K7_CLvlTK-lRr8E_pvSwg5WcOLXQU-rBEYGy_Eajxgd7Z_H86QLuIFb7sZgosrgDBdzsd_BFKN6UyZP1GuZQ6yRhrQwHhBBPnpyjiImmFTGuwEpPce-R24sKNrykXFVvSRsHf6oz__DweiNa_3IscZ46ICIJyYtqU36pQHIt_hCgk6oSP_hXd1sXNV2h447BT_tf0ZDAtqRYeLgvPvlJFp6MZw9UJYwamJnRbjzh51OGxDGElJRB615M_0uGiYEz0dCK3S1fUjwPstorVvE6aNEcV5zPBtNrtqgKnO0henjUAouOPUZvMSpwBLfHwiE8tpaZm6A\">https://www.ginkointernational.com.tw/index_tw.php#_</a></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">✅</span></span> 桃園虎頭山創新園區 <span class=\"_5mfr\"><span class=\"_6qdm\">🐯</span></span></p>\r\n<p>桃園是全臺第一的工業科技大城，工業產值連續14年全國第一。除了坐擁航空及汽車零組件等多元而完整的產業聚落，更臨近機場國門，讓桃園市政府配合中央亞洲・矽谷計畫規劃的「虎頭山創新園區」，從一開始籌備就備受注目。</p>\r\n<p>甫於6月18日正式開幕的虎頭山創新園區第一期，是全臺首座結合「車聯智駕中心」與「資安物聯網中心」的測試研發基地。總統蔡英文親自出席開幕典禮，提出「臺灣產業發展的未來在人工智慧結合物聯網（AIOT），而AIOT的未來在桃園」。桃園市長鄭文燦表示，虎頭山創新園區是「亞洲・矽谷計畫」的亮點之一，要建構臺灣車用電子與物聯網的實際研發與驗證場域，搶先布局打入國際。</p>\r\n<p>相關新聞：<br />\r\n <a href=\"https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829&amp;fbclid=IwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fcity.gvm.com.tw%2Farticle.html%3Fid%3D66829%26fbclid%3DIwAR2gzwCMA_emuj0FgXgQCh9lYz_MXsLhWvNlHBwIai9sfkbyKGMdTmjj104&amp;h=AT2VCTCzMchJ8oxAXQIniG8HmKO-R4zXGu-NE0KMtpJdDzT7Z32d25MyPpp12vgbwVFWPi3M7n6SKMXsrcO4wXq8SXI2ndC5ulMpBcGJa1rfNOy0Z_21q86oXcLDZzToDOeUH9UfgC47_HmSJMVFBgTh7NRYJgXo1UWu_MkBDv-ltAtaPNc2u_Zs1TLBaVmUByAek-f-dp1WZ5TO2cvu9pIMn1_i-6wCVTXGbkDRC2GptRxKDktld6DA1FIMnF8anbYK5TnjOdg6Q9H1S79oyBdBY9z2lH83Aqtz2eLkePHMnZqFuEjS3oUPLCRCsT_FRSSLg0Ui42KgbD690DSRlUbALCFh3tQvvcPNPwFWhcNOYHE6lp7kSh9wWlFtsoXC0sU8iC1Yjkw9blnGXPCs2vaBeIhe1icF68CzJQBpR9n3MCpCufZLBWe8NUcPOpSFvGPiLVgGOqWHCFuL8VYP1_vIXRE3FIispCZ4AtAkW6Llpj-zSslbv5HzYeX0INwnSvEuzHbxusYfCZ0T_Ht9QuDpCVvAERwY2osL37U7Gt7zGvHSjwJ5ggyhoWhDWI8dk8fTlzF1PqRFV2YPBzrIpHkENTrAEnw5LtiX118K2H5P1j3SHrhS1DFvYypQGDnMWN7R0eFy41M\">https://city.gvm.com.tw/article.html?id=66829</a></p>\r\n</div>', 'ASTCC+WTCC🌍世總第25屆回國訪問暨5+2產業投資考察團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3357-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-09-16 18:04:46', '2019-09-16 10:04:46', '', 3357, 'http://localhost/astcc/3357-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
