(4050, 4, '2020-12-19 14:59:52', '2020-12-19 06:59:52', '日期:2020年7月21日\n\n時間:AM11:20-12:30\n\n拜訪單位:僑務委員會<!--more-->\n\n參加人員:28屆亞總 劉樹添,賴昭哲,蔡雯慧,張南蘋,葉榮林.周筑梵,陳潘淼,林再良,李峰春,李秉憲,李奇賢.\n<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總新團隊訪僑委會 童振源表達對臺商紓困的重視</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會總會長劉樹添一行於7月21日拜會僑委會，由委員長童振源偕副委員長徐佳青一同接見。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">童振源首先恭喜劉樹添及賴昭哲接任亞總第28屆總會長及監事長，並表示蔡總統非常關切海外臺商紓困問題，行政院與僑委會正密切研議由海外信用保證基金擴大協助更多受疫情衝擊的僑臺商。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">更多詳情請參閱僑務電子報：</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.ocacnews.net/overseascommunity/article/article_story.jsp?id=260166&amp;fbclid=IwAR10ibuOC-D1hS5VTj2PJRoWH9PDInOuri3CsZ29OiLouotEQWhVFSUqcYM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.ocacnews.net/ove.../article/article_story.jsp...</a></div>\n</div>\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3866\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/asass.png\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3867\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/asdsadasdas.png\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總第28屆團隊訪僑委會 童振源委員長表達對臺商紓困的重視', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3845-autosave-v1', '', '', '2020-12-19 14:59:52', '2020-12-19 06:59:52', '', 3845, 'http://localhost/astcc/3845-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
