(4184, 4, '2021-10-07 19:33:27', '2021-10-07 11:33:27', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">9/8農業金融研討會</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">分享和檢討農業金融體系的相關業務成效、評估成立新業務的必要性，彙整各方意見，研提具體建議，作為未來工作推動參考。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">研討會分為四大主題：</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">「農業貸款暨資訊整合」、「農業保險和農民退休儲金」、「農業創投」、「農業金融創新」。</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">主辦單位：全國農業金庫</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">指導單位：行政院農業委員會</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">協辦單位：中央畜產會、中華民國太陽光電發電系統同業公會、中華民國四健會協會、中華民 國全國漁會、中華民國農會、中興大學國際產學聯盟、台灣飼料工業同業公會、台灣農村經濟學會、亞洲台灣商會聯合總會、農業信用保證基金(筆畫序)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新聞連結分享</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://money.udn.com/money/story/5635/5734791?fbclid=IwAR17dF2HB74sTs44GV6ViQhk7M26OL-GJkAVYhfJRfXcYYPfJ2MQcSSLPc0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://money.udn.com/money/story/5635/5734791</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e8%be%b2%e6%a5%ad%e9%87%91%e8%9e%8d%e7%a0%94%e8%a8%8e%e6%9c%83/%e8%be%b2%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%831/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4185\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4185\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/農委會1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"218\" /></a> <a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e8%be%b2%e6%a5%ad%e9%87%91%e8%9e%8d%e7%a0%94%e8%a8%8e%e6%9c%83/%e8%be%b2%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%832/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4187\"><img