(4321, 4, '2022-03-09 11:11:31', '2022-03-09 03:11:31', '<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本總會轄下之青商會已成立十年，精心製作「黃金十週年紀念特刊」，以回顧與展望的起點提供充分的背景資訊，讓內部及各界瞭解亞青，更具傳承之意義。已於7月1日至7月12日在臉書粉絲專頁依序開始連載！歡迎前往閱讀！</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">「新時代 向前進 飛躍未來」</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t93/1.5/16/31_20e3.png\" alt=\"1️⃣\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>壹. 健全組織，培育青商</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞青簡介與沿革、會歌、聯盟組織、十週年紀念徽章及吉祥物</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb2/1.5/16/32_20e3.png\" alt=\"2️⃣\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>貳. 鑑往知今，承先啟後</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總歷史沿革、歷屆總會長及監事長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td1/1.5/16/33_20e3.png\" alt=\"3️⃣\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>叁. 壯志成城，十年有成</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞青歷屆會長、感言與祝福、核心幹部、理監事名單、活動照片</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf0/1.5/16/34_20e3.png\" alt=\"4️⃣\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>肆. 緣起商會，連結亞洲</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞青各會員體簡介、感言與祝福、歷屆會長、當屆活動照片</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">粉專連結：</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0