(4333, 4, '2022-03-09 11:37:01', '2022-03-09 03:37:01', '<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">僑務委員會首度主辦的「海外臺商精品獎」，於12月7日盛大舉行頒獎典禮。為協助推廣海外臺商優良產品及塑造品牌優質形象，本次選拔活動共有亞洲7國總計13件海外臺商優質產品脫穎而出，包含金質獎6件與銀質獎7件。 現場嘉賓如雲，本總會 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E6%B1%9F%E7%A6%8F%E9%BE%8D?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVkCRd-Ax0fGL9Cb-sPCVx1us5AvF4EW1WlPSvTjKWpZrmDsY4Rzm--uwxdJ2Omd8RfhDP-dOKwQ4OVl5Qbtv5Kk9E2J3fMZNa_ih6h341mnXDjKlHzhDg2NJnPIHLBI3CqU1tf5cCNdwugDIpo9d__45qjRHpfInWrGDqq_UIKrNw1ua_Xvll4pJ3Epx0trMI&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">＃江福龍</a> 總會長亦代表出席此盛會。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n\r\n<a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 py34i1dx\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://ocacnews.net/article/297501?fbclid=IwAR23VIvyKYCCtpwZb8UnudXIuFLwAHCv0V5COmPhemKqgyyo-pC7iTYzma0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://ocacnews.net/article/297501</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '僑委會首屆海外臺商精品獎頒獎典禮 助臺商建立品牌行銷全球', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e9%a6%96%e5%b1%86%e6%b5%b7%e5%a4%96%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e7%b2%be%e5%93%81%e7%8d%8e%e9%a0%92%e7%8d%8e%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae-%e5%8a%a9%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e5%bb%ba%e7%ab%8b%e5%93%81', '', '', '2024-07-29 14:58:03', '2024-07-29 06:58:03', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=4333', 0, 'post', '', 0),
