noopener noreferrer\">https://www.president.gov.tw/NEWS/26730</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">英文總統接見「亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會第29屆回國訪問團」，統鼓勵臺商朋友返臺投資，一起壯大臺灣經濟發展。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">影片連結:</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 py34i1dx\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2Fxo2zTZZ0B3A%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR0mQ5vZciXL_5EoZ9wTUkbkJJzlwqEf75OCSJqG3xnwRXJrnkqtF0BHjn0&amp;h=AT0NghCU0fWUhNSS0dQXSqNpjkZY2eqUgD5XC1Jnu8tixyWxA9-vIUEHJ8Ku8S7o3Kq3lsjJJ8snxQMCI9m1j8_9VqDxQ-x2gcX3c8zKhrNb0hprFpJoSKRts_d_Tp_ki-Lz&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT0ClXwTG94tIsta3fWwx-iTfljedId39crEPHukWajq-fJwoVNwPy70fan8ijOFgR7kIkdYWBl-fzkl5JaYcxP5wa7tdYGbZ9ftAyyf63So_FYAoSnB3HcXs2BGzq9a3bE0jadLiMHZ4P1m5OiSXpj1qvBsXehd-C-MiWPpy-uQjkOxyT2d4-z8bE7GszWBavGbUCsPhggLvdPU7KwlwIO21x09JtIlkVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://youtu.be/xo2zTZZ0B3A</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/4461-2/%e7%b8%bd%e7%b5%b1%e5%ba%9c/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4462\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4462\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/總統府.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會第29屆回國訪問團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4461-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:23:50', '2022-08-19 02:23:50', '', 4461, 'http://localhost/astcc/4461-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4503, 1, '2022-08-19 10:24:32', '2022-08-19 02:24:32', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">柬埔寨臺商協會會長王美蕙偕同多位鄉親於4月7日前往柬埔寨金邊市國家嬰兒和兒童中心，贈送新年禮物及捐贈生活物資，受到該中心全員熱烈歡迎。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 py34i1dx\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://ocacnews.net/article/307093?cid=3&amp;fbclid=IwAR3bIbbp2GxkQcxUK8jfm6R4Bv_GI4Wvk1L8e0wSi3EvHSz6VEAROKK0wGI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://ocacnews.net/article/307093?cid=3</a><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e6%9f%ac%e5%9f%94%e5%af%a8%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83-%e6%96%b0%e5%b9%b4%e9%80%81%e6%9a%96%e5%8a%a9%e6%9f%ac%e5%9f%94%e5%af%a8%e5%ac%b0%e5%b9%bc%e7%ab%a5/%e6%9a%96%e5%8a%a9%e5%b9%bc%e7%ab%a5-%e6%9f%ac/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4450\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4450\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/暖助幼童-柬.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '柬埔寨臺商協會 新年送暖助柬埔寨嬰幼童', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4449-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:24:32', '2022-08-19 02:24:32', '', 4449, 'http://localhost/astcc/4449-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4515, 1, '2022-08-19 10:28:13', '2022-08-19 02:28:13', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">恭祝</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新年快樂 虎年行大運</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">總會長 江福龍</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">監事長 洪勝統</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">敬祝</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e6%96%b0%e5%b9%b4%e5%bf%ab%e6%a8%82-%e8%99%8e%e5%b9%b4%e8%a1%8c%e5%a4%a7%e9%81%8b/%e8%be%b2%e6%9b%86%e9%81%8e%e5%b9%b4/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4398\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4398 size-large\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/農曆過年-700x497.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"497\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '新年快樂 虎年行大運', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4397-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:28:13', '2022-08-19 02:28:13', '', 4397, 'http://localhost/astcc/4397-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
