2022-08-19 02:41:46', '', 4152, 'http://localhost/astcc/4152-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4534, 1, '2022-08-19 10:42:06', '2022-08-19 02:42:06', '<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">8/3江總會長帶領亞總劉樹添輔導會長、賴維信名譽總會長、劉美德名譽監事長、張南蘋名譽監事長、林登峰秘書長、莊炳陽財務長、亞總各國副會長及代表、亞青江佩珊會長及謝佳恩秘書長等20名亞總代表，拜訪立法院游院長、僑委會童委員長及僑委會徐副委員長、張處長。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">立法院游院長及童委員長都很關心海外僑胞在疫情期間的健康及事業狀況，並就疫情措施、台商包機、海外台商醫療物資、醫療泡泡、台商申請海外信託基金等議題交換意見，晤談約1小時。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">江總會長提到，立法院是最支持台商的政府機構之一，對於各國政府因為疫情所實施的封城及管制，造成各地台商經濟損失，亞洲台灣商會聯合總會將持續協助海外台商，也很願意成為前鋒，未來期待與政府一起攜手繼續努力。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">感謝僑委會與立法院作為海外台商的堅強後盾！</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新聞連結分享：</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://yns.page.link/KzbJx?fbclid=IwAR3YwFGQ7KF6KJFT486gUaPbTMxjoEnR54qHOPL40U2tweuEiZ_9MfH4jdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://yns.page.link/KzbJx</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/slide/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac29%e5%b1%86%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e7%ab%8b%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2/s__4538442-3/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4094\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4094 aligncenter\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/S__4538442-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/slide/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac29%e5%b1%86%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e5%83%91%e5%8b%99%e5%a7%94%e5%93%a1%e6%9c%83/%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%832-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4100\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4100 aligncenter\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/拜會僑委會2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總拜會立法院游院長及僑委會童委員長', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4162-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:42:06', '2022-08-19 02:42:06', '', 4162, 'http://localhost/astcc/4162-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4535, 1, '2022-08-19 10:43:35', '2022-08-19 02:43:35', '<p style=\"text-align: left;\">本總會7/19於線上辦理總會長與監事長交接典禮後，即由新任總會長江福龍擔任會議主席召開第29屆第1次理監事會議，感謝各位理監事參與，會議圓滿成功。<!--more--></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac29%e5%b1%86%e7%ac%ac1%e6%ac%a1%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd29-1-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4156\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4156 size-medium\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/亞總29-1-2-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" data-wp-editing=\"1\" /></a> <a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac29%e5%b1%86%e7%ac%ac1%e6%ac%a1%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd29-1-3/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4157\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4157 size-medium\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/亞總29-1-3-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" /></a><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac29%e5%b1%86%e7%ac%ac1%e6%ac%a1%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0/%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd29-1-1/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4155\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4155 size-medium\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/亞總29-1-1-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" /></a>', '亞總第29屆第1次理監事會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4154-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:43:35', '2022-08-19 02:43:35', '', 4154, 'http://localhost/astcc/4154-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4536, 1, '2022-08-19 10:43:52', '2022-08-19 02:43:52', '<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本總會於昨日 (7/19)於線上舉辦第28屆第三次理監事會議，共約500多位理監事參與。隨後舉行第28、29屆總會長和監事長交接典禮，由選委主委 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl q66pz984 gpro0wi8 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8A%89%E7%BE%8E%E5%BE%B7?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVaauf7-BoTlHap5e92pSfDO4BtqiBV7RO9aOAOzRd17SARMdnbOuM9Z6U3eHFqjwnj_1z7mQDwqgNzaOd1JNyKx-_BFAwr2KjCDWvv3Iaw_R2MQxnfpY_wBsauB99g9Kx9ZacgOQ--vX7qH3a1ZXiFO4jbo2J5Rkej2sxbkNVhiEPC_OJYEG-jDywZy8N6ris&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">劉美德</a> 頒發當選證書，並在僑委會委員長 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl q66pz984 gpro0wi8 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E7%AB%A5%E6%8C%AF%E6%BA%90?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVaauf7-BoTlHap5e92pSfDO4BtqiBV7RO9aOAOzRd17SARMdnbOuM9Z6U3eHFqjwnj_1z7mQDwqgNzaOd1JNyKx-_BFAwr2KjCDWvv3Iaw_R2MQxnfpY_wBsauB99g9Kx9ZacgOQ--vX7qH3a1ZXiFO4jbo2J5Rkej2sxbkNVhiEPC_OJYEG-jDywZy8N6ris&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">童振源</a> 的見證下，第29屆總會長江福龍，以及監事長洪勝統正式交接，肩負起服務亞洲僑臺商的重責。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td9/1.5/16/1f64f.png\" alt=\"🙏\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>感謝第28屆總會長 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h es