(4561, 1, '2022-08-19 10:55:45', '2022-08-19 02:55:45', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">僑委會委員長童振源、龍華科大校長葛自祥共同簽署合作意向書，並邀請桃園市副市長高安邦、泰國貿易經濟辦事處代理代表馬化欣，亞洲台灣商會聯合總會江福龍總會長，以及孫道亨董事長、林如貞行政副校長、陳逸謙學術副校長、楊安渡助理副校長等人共同為基地揭牌，為泰國臺商企業人才培育及台泰民間交流，樹立嶄新的里程碑。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">相關連結</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fliff.line.me%2F1454987169-1WAXAP3K%2Fv2%2Farticle%2FPGGkZE0%3Futm_source%3Dlineshare%26fbclid%3DIwAR37GUedfZJxiyjiJb6NNGk_KZjDYCd6dnJBEimEaPgnvDCW_HA3Obgug3g&amp;h=AT1yZpgRgWis4hqs9wnBlKUfkW7tiQRklQrcZhvWYN_tFF7YamKdzr6Y5hYseOQK1X8EMmV-ByZAwkvYTRw83tjD154WWOkLzyUTYTDsF-c63QZAV9e3hbfUm6KNN6nKL2qj&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT0Yd-y0lmauWoVB-FjFuPb_511EVKgStbfIzd3blz2LJHuYiaTRGmdN7Ld88BxpKJqS3kmnrmJ1Wl9IOVTlEbQ3cGVFx6AQ3cPx815pL_GqFv8eLQyM4sLuDQtor6krjsAPliK0VYBNOQEpZh-EllEjul75VVm42H9mL8Sut-HTlzho36_9C8PcqD-hp2SAMF6lJvPk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://liff.line.me/14549871....../v2/article/PGGkZE0......</a><a href=\"http://localhost/astcc/%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e6%94%9c%e6%89%8b%e9%be%8d%e8%8f%af%e7%a7%91%e5%a4%a7%e6%88%90%e7%ab%8b%e9%ab%98%e7%a7%91%e6%8a%80%e4%ba%ba%e6%89%8d%e5%9f%b9%e8%a8%93%e5%9f%ba%e5%9c%b0-%e5%8a%a9%e6%b3%b0/%e9%be%8d%e8%8f%af/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4246\"><img class=\"wp-image-4246 size-large aligncenter\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/龍華-700x447.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"447\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '僑委會攜手龍華科大成立高科技人才培訓基地 助泰僑臺商轉型升級', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4245-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10: