(5453, 7, '2023-09-07 10:28:32', '2023-09-07 02:28:32', '<div class=\"container02\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 24pt;\">「連結亞洲、共好臺灣。」</span></h2>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2023.8/31-9/01亞總第一次組團專業企業返台觀展，聽到參加成員的肯定，所有的辛苦都值得了😁😁😁連結亞洲-五國二十六人的專業企業參訪團，返台參觀智慧農漁畜展覽，同時拜會僑委會及農業部。共好台灣-應用台灣展會的資源，結合臺灣企業強力的研發、製造動能，提高僑居國農漁畜效能，創造台灣、僑居地、台商三贏共好。</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">#三會簽署MOU：亞洲台商聯合總會、聯絡協會、科技農企業協會。</span></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">#感謝僑委會大力協助及接待🙏🙏</span></span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">#第一次拜會農業部😁😁  以前都是拜會農委會🤭🤭</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">感謝幕後鄭文忠秘書長和所有副秘書長放下自己的工作、生意，協助串連和不斷修改的文書作業，辛苦你們了！😅😅</span>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">新聞連結：<a href=\"https://ocacnews.net/article/349163\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\">https://ocacnews.net/article/349163</a></span>\r\n\r\n[video width=\"960\" height=\"540\" mp4=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908video001.mp4\"][/video]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"container01\">\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg001.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg002.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg003-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg004.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg005-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg006.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"imgbox\"><img src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/0908photoimg007-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n    </div>', '三會MOU簽署儀式', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'picture-book12', '', '', '2023-09-07 10:46:24', '2023-09-07 02:46:24', '', 4613, 'http://localhost/astcc/?page_id=5453', 11, 'page', '', 0),
