(5886, 10, '2024-07-29 15:09:54', '2024-07-29 07:09:54', '鑒於臺灣於亞洲各國的投資合作量能持續上升，各類法律服務需求亦隨之增加。為協助亞洲各國臺商充實法律知識、評估法律風險、解決法律爭議並促進各項權益保障，本會與全國律師聯合會於7月17日在台北君悅飯店簽訂合作備忘錄，共同合作提供亞洲各國臺商法律顧問服務，自簽署之日起生效至2025 年7 月16 日止，為期一年。期滿後雙方得以書面方式展延。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5887\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452194891_476689518339889_5187726305937885863_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5888\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452192163_476689471673227_1148382612766027366_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5889\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452114786_476689505006557_6976866862529973490_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5890\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452099757_476689488339892_1161063478370699087_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '與全國律師聯合會簽訂合作備忘錄', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%88%87%e5%85%a8%e5%9c%8b%e5%be%8b%e5%b8%ab%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e6%9c%83%e7%b0%bd%e8%a8%82%e5%90%88%e4%bd%9c%e5%82%99%e5%bf%98%e9%8c%84', '', '', '2024-10-31 18:01:18', '2024-10-31 10:01:18', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=5886', 0, 'post', '', 0),
