(6028, 10, '2024-08-07 17:16:07', '2024-08-07 09:16:07', '7月23日 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">日本臺灣商會聯合總會</span> 新任會長東郷清龍、監事長藤田礼子、副財務長廖珮君、副祕書長黃駿升及李建霖等一行人前往駐福岡辦事處拜訪處長陳銘俊，就加強九州地區合作展開深入交流。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6027\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/452874541_478883834787124_4491852428165192913_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '日總拜會駐福岡辦事處', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6026-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-08-07 17:16:07', '2024-08-07 09:16:07', '', 6026, 'http://localhost/astcc/6026-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6029, 10, '2024-08-07 17:23:53', '2024-08-07 09:23:53', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">世界台灣商會聯合總會</span>李天柒總會長率領各洲洲總會長及重要成員組成「世界台灣商會聯合總會第30屆回國訪問暨投資考察團，前往總統府晉見總統及拜會各政府部門。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">首日7月18日賴清德總統接見此團，由僑務委員會委員長徐佳青陪同，總統府秘書長潘孟安也在座。賴總統感謝世總及臺商朋友做為臺灣與各國的橋梁，讓世界看見臺灣，展現臺灣的實力。盼結合臺商力量　讓臺灣產業更進步、經濟升級、社會更繁榮發展。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">兩天的訪團行程另也拜會交通部、立法院、經濟部、外交部、僑委會、環境部、行政院、衛福部、勞動部及全國農業金庫。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6030\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/452194346_477132334962274_6320964812486615535_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6031\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/452426278_477132271628947_9198123711942790120_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6032\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/452429046_477132314962276_3690803477664969340_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6033\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/452512934_477132218295619_7061484431412857769_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '世總第30屆回國訪問暨投資考察團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%b8%96%e7%b8%bd%e7%ac%ac30%e5%b1%86%e5%9b%9e%e5%9c%8b%e8%a8%aa%e5%95%8f%e6%9a%a8%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2024-08-07 17:28:31', '2024-08-07 09:28:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6029', 0, 'post', '', 0),
