(6228, 10, '2024-10-31 17:01:34', '2024-10-31 09:01:34', '於8月24日上午本會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span>、名譽總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">賴維信</span>偕同世界台灣商會聯合總會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">李天柒</span>率團專程前往訪視泰國台灣商會聯合總會，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n與本會創會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">余聲清</span>、名譽總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">劉樹添</span>及該國總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳漢川</span>、及多位當地僑領共敘情誼，就亞總會務進行報告及交流。林總會長並鄭重邀請與會者參加本屆即將於馬來西亞吉隆坡舉辦的第二次理監事會議，本會秘書長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">康耀忠</span>及副祕書長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林宇馨</span>亦隨行參與，現場氣氛歡樂融洽。結束後，進行午餐餐敘。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6230\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457243694_501188342556673_853249453084642231_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6233\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457278663_501188309223343_3196633210515721638_n-250x114.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6229\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457228034_501188522556655_2314042394081065986_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6231\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457257296_501188539223320_8515740437178877841_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6232\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457259519_501188605889980_8621937445514021621_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6234\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457467916_501188495889991_523536674633808179_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '訪視泰國台灣商會聯合總會', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%a8%aa%e8%a6%96%e6%b3%b0%e5%9c%8b%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83', '', '', '2024-10-31 18:00:23', '2024-10-31 10:00:23', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6228', 0, 'post', '', 0),
