(6257, 10, '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '在駐帛琉大使黎倩儀及帛琉商會會長的陪同之下，亞總帛琉投資考察團於9月3日下午參觀帛琉國家水產中心，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n此為台灣政府派駐研究員協助帛琉國家水產中心提升運作效率，包括改善微藻培養、飼料儲藏、增加種魚與魚苗培育面積及計畫管理辦公空間。\r\n結束後參加駐帛琉黎倩儀大使晚宴，財政部長、國務部長、人力資源文化觀光部長MHRCT、帛琉商會會長等當地政府官員及在地台商會員應邀出席，現場歡笑不斷，氣氛熱絡。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6259\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458707666_507208218621352_4347689459743859020_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6260\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458759603_507208565287984_3374955969812933090_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6264\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459139203_507208578621316_5315998452183016164_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6263\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458964142_507208511954656_8620068213423054319_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6261\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458764298_507208255288015_5679694552466687973_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6262\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458962510_507208385288002_9059233916645283382_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6258\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458666881_507208305288010_3374623539464700597_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總帛琉投資考察團參觀帛琉國家水產中心', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f%e5%9c%98%e5%8f%83%e8%a7%80%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%b6%e6%b0%b4%e7%94%a2%e4%b8%ad%e5%bf%83', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6257', 0, 'post', '', 0),
