(6305, 10, '2024-10-31 17:41:40', '2024-10-31 09:41:40', '9月25日上午亞總團隊拜會屏東縣政府，由縣長周春米親自接待。期待各國後續與屏東有更多產業合作的機會，讓世界看見屏東。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6303\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461480751_521767463832094_4264478287615336831_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總團隊拜會屏東縣政府', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6302-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:41:40', '2024-10-31 09:41:40', '', 6302, 'http://localhost/astcc/6302-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
