(6347, 10, '2024-11-06 16:12:04', '2024-11-06 08:12:04', '<div id=\"js_is\" class=\"x1xqt7ti xm46was x1xlr1w8 x1jrz1v4 xbsr9hj x1yc453h xuxw1ft x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv x1h4wwuj xeuugli\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\">【日總青商會舉辦商業講座暨交流餐會】</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x1xqt7ti xm46was x1xlr1w8 x1jrz1v4 xbsr9hj x1yc453h xuxw1ft x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv x1h4wwuj xeuugli\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\">日本台灣商會聯合總會青商會於10月19日在東京舉辦了年度商業講座暨交流餐會，由該會會長林德修及團隊邀請日本台灣聯合總會榮譽總會長詹德薰，分享商會發展的歷史以及個人的創業經歷，勉勵年輕人勇敢面對、接受挑戰。現場多位當地台商先進前輩出席支持。會後交流餐會氣氛熱烈，來自不同產業的朋友與青商們積極互動，活動圓滿成功。 <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6344\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/464152698_537693978906109_5437719901868005951_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6345\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/464196506_537693992239441_3684979086993796655_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6346\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/464203491_537693998906107_3660134075881815149_n-250x157.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '日總青商會舉辦商業講座暨交流餐會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6343-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:12:04', '2024-11-06 08:12:04', '', 6343, 'http://localhost/astcc/6343-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
