(6355, 10, '2024-11-06 16:22:23', '2024-11-06 08:22:23', '菲律賓臺商總會青商會於9月15日舉辦中秋節「博中秋」慶祝活動，由該總會總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林登峰</span>及青商會會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳義</span>主持，此次活動吸引了眾多臺商會員及其家人參加，現場氣氛熱烈溫馨，共同歡度中秋佳節。\r\n\r\n<!--more--><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6356\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/460323135_513090771366430_2810278050836870519_n-250x121.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '菲總青商會舉辦中秋活動', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e9%9d%92%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e4%b8%ad%e7%a7%8b%e6%b4%bb%e5%8b%95', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:29:19', '2024-11-06 08:29:19', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6355', 0, 'post', '', 0),
