(6363, 10, '2024-11-06 16:27:10', '2024-11-06 08:27:10', '印尼臺灣工商聯誼會青商會於9月21日假雅加達臺灣工商聯誼會會館舉辦「臺印結婚手續及最新工作簽證座談會」，邀請資深投顧專家李曉芬分享結婚及工作簽證相關手續申辦之最新規定。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6362\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/461930357_523831556959018_6140254285408976339_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '印總青商會舉辦臺印結婚手續及最新工作簽證座談', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6361-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:27:10', '2024-11-06 08:27:10', '', 6361, 'http://localhost/astcc/6361-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6364, 10, '2024-11-06 16:31:05', '2024-11-06 08:31:05', '2019亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會-活動影片精彩回顧：<!--more-->\r\n\r\n亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會於7月16日假桃園桃禧航空城酒店舉行第8屆第3次理監事會及第9屆第1次理監事會，計有來自亞洲8個青商會員國代表及全球各地貴賓共襄盛舉。青商會於當日特別發表自創曲「亞青之歌-台灣少年郎」並搭配青商活動花絮錄製精美MV，充分展現海外青商源源不絕的創新力及衝勁十足的執行力!歡迎大家點選瀏覽!<!--more-->\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-3370 size-medium alignleft\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67663628_2398822620212168_2111690816484278272_n-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" />\r\n\r\n影片來源：亞洲台灣商會聯合總會青商會<span class=\"text_exposed_show\">\r\n<a href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2FH06dVwahMbE%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3u4zdAQLx7Q75Uh66cjqzBnOW9m5TYKdBNa15KuKATcCsjklHHscqbxaM&amp;h=AT085zZvxaMCUne2tciDOxMHtImdYF8-IyRLjdFtma5R4iQ2inDJemGAcr9VHcmWAAV6l2XvfyWpskCmgunkxeJKWVT2Pl6dQXyNDrHCl5Kt6Dd38b5t4JegnQajmqj6c5CEYTV_sz1WLHVOeFn8RU8qrHZ3Ty0XS6HY1CXiNFwIeNE9qDFj9iDibMeFNP9QUsfIRmrXJT9xhWREqMjFNuky8MLH2vgnHO_NBooC8Cc3T86li069t2XfDxanJzYcPGyYHDkK6L7p4vrbwKfQW4My4n2FMPlMA29HqLRAiYkBbp6fB7AtrtDPcXVRf8zwuHj1YrtOAX05oAUq-qK-7TZsL-rirP1gnWl4e3y1EQ8EJOqIIJn5T2f8WEdPKsqfvQcxJmj6OcVPa2AdGecSvCs6UWav1WckFFJMWoH9bufDxmrfDOKqLaDiPU2uxrWeRzCfJjbpAN6UX6lnhengz__ZDGt_g_xl-NDopU6FnjDhv1tvnSgGlQzMhQ_5tJ1s0C65e5lBOFY5ITq9qjJ9o1_vEeLytJQs1MLp8CqV06iGKDn7lwRv4i8mdsYPK72RBWbnS4FxnayVUMSDY9gFmoqX1vmAb5uCZ4ykl6-su2Hs-kThsgIbraFnPbhQlbYdd1U23gs1EPyKslcMlfB74whbKh66DZp0WG141Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\">https://youtu.be/H06dVwahMbE</a></span>\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-3369 alignright\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/67398349_2398723836888713_4171457522764349440_n-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;', '2019亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會青商會-活動影片精彩回顧', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3355-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:31:05', '2024-11-06 08:31:05', '', 3355, 'http://localhost/astcc/3355-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
