(6432, 10, '2024-11-11 09:42:23', '2024-11-11 01:42:23', '馬來西亞台灣商會聯合總會假檳城於2024年8月10日召開第17屆第4次理監事會議。<!--more-->由該會總會長林凱民主持，駐馬代表處葉非比大使也受邀蒞臨主持開幕式，當地及來自馬來西亞各地的理監事和會員與會出席，討論各項會務及交流\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6431\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455025070_490743643601143_1778232635388614893_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '馬總召開第17屆第4次理監事會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6430-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:42:23', '2024-11-11 01:42:23', '', 6430, 'http://localhost/astcc/6430-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6433, 10, '2024-11-11 09:43:58', '2024-11-11 01:43:58', '在理監事會議後，<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">檳城州台灣商會許上智會長</span> 率領團隊所辦理的“ <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">台灣之夜</span>”於8月10日盛大舉辦。<!--more--><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6434\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455261919_490167420325432_5784419791017360786_n-250x105.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '馬總舉辦‘台灣之夜‘晚宴', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%a6%ac%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e4%b9%8b%e5%a4%9c%e6%99%9a%e5%ae%b4', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:43:58', '2024-11-11 01:43:58', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6433', 0, 'post', '', 0),
