(6435, 10, '2024-11-11 09:43:58', '2024-11-11 01:43:58', '在理監事會議後，<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">檳城州台灣商會許上智會長</span> 率領團隊所辦理的“ <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">台灣之夜</span>”於8月10日盛大舉辦。<!--more--><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6434\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455261919_490167420325432_5784419791017360786_n-250x105.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '馬總舉辦‘台灣之夜‘晚宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6433-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:43:58', '2024-11-11 01:43:58', '', 6433, 'http://localhost/astcc/6433-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6436, 10, '2024-11-11 09:46:02', '2024-11-11 01:46:02', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">越南台灣商會聯合總會 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">蔡文瑞</span>總會長與多位代表與駐越南台北經濟文化代表處<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">石瑞琦</span>大使及同仁於於8月8日中午餐敘交流。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">席間除了越南與柬埔寨近況商情交流外，蔡總會長也向石大使報告目前本會VBF財經交流委員會已向VBF送件申請成為正式會員(Consortium Member)，正在審查階段，石大使表示樂觀其成，也謝謝台商總會的努力。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6437\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455788985_493449343330573_7956588096204455963_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '越總與駐越南台北經濟文化代表處餐敘', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%b6%8a%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%87%e9%a7%90%e8%b6%8a%e5%8d%97%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e7%b6%93%e6%bf%9f%e6%96%87%e5%8c%96%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e8%99%95%e9%a4%90%e6%95%98', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:46:20', '2024-11-11 01:46:20', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6436', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(6437, 10, '2024-11-11 09:45:58', '2024-11-11 01:45:58', '', '455788985_493449343330573_7956588096204455963_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '455788985_493449343330573_7956588096204455963_n', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:45:58', '2024-11-11 01:45:58', '', 6436, 'http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455788985_493449343330573_7956588096204455963_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6438, 10, '2024-11-11 09:46:02', '2024-11-11 01:46:02', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">越南台灣商會聯合總會 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">蔡文瑞</span>總會長與多位代表與駐越南台北經濟文化代表處<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">石瑞琦</span>大使及同仁於於8月8日中午餐敘交流。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">席間除了越南與柬埔寨近況商情交流外，蔡總會長也向石大使報告目前本會VBF財經交流委員會已向VBF送件申請成為正式會員(Consortium Member)，正在審查階段，石大使表示樂觀其成，也謝謝台商總會的努力。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6437\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455788985_493449343330573_7956588096204455963_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '越總與駐越南台北經濟文化代表處餐敘', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6436-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:46:02', '2024-11-11 01:46:02', '', 6436, 'http://localhost/astcc/6436-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6439, 10, '2024-11-11 09:47:52', '2024-11-11 01:47:52', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">屏東縣長周春米率領縣府團隊出訪日本沖繩</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">，8月4日由日本台灣商會聯合總會總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">東郷清龍</span>率領幾位幹部陪同考察那霸市公營牧志市場。視察途中，並與該會名譽總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">新垣旬子</span>所舉辦的「暑期兒童華語教室」合影留念。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">8月5日拜會沖繩縣縣政府，由沖繩玉城縣知事 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">玉城丹尼</span> 親自接待。當天並在那霸市四つ竹久米店舉辦交流懇親會，來自沖繩及全國政財界的貴賓應邀參加。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6440\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/455832244_493959089946265_5077182101744666051_n-250x201.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6441\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/456053464_493959103279597_2746737705070566115_n-1-250x177.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6442\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/456053464_493959103279597_2746737705070566115_n-250x177.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '日總陪同接待屏東縣長縣府訪團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%97%a5%e7%b8%bd%e9%99%aa%e5%90%8c%e6%8e%a5%e5%be%85%e5%b1%8f%e6%9d%b1%e7%b8%a3%e9%95%b7%e7%b8%a3%e5%ba%9c%e8%a8%aa%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2024-11-11 09:47:52', '2024-11-11 01:47:52', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6439', 0, 'post', '', 0),
