(6452, 10, '2024-11-11 10:33:52', '2024-11-11 02:33:52', '為慶祝即將到來的中秋節，柬埔寨台商協會於本月25日在棉芷區宋仁芷三分區董健三號路的國家嬰兒和兒童中心（NBIC）舉辦中秋送暖公益活動。由協會會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳來埤</span>及多位幹部一同前往，捐贈物資並陪伴小朋友們共度中秋佳節。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6451\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/1574076550161488271-250x131.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '柬總舉辦中秋送暖公益活動', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6450-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-11 10:33:52', '2024-11-11 02:33:52', '', 6450, 'http://localhost/astcc/6450-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6453, 10, '2024-11-11 10:35:24', '2024-11-11 02:35:24', '日本台灣商會聯合總會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">東鄉清龍</span>於8月22日連同該會名譽總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">謝美香</span>、<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳五福</span>、<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">錢妙玲</span>及幹部會員一齊前往熊本縣、熊本市、熊本商工會議所、菊陽町進行禮貌性拜訪。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6454\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/456989060_498840846124756_4088228707849312751_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '日總拜會熊本県木村知事', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%97%a5%e7%b8%bd%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e7%86%8a%e6%9c%ac%e7%9c%8c%e6%9c%a8%e6%9d%91%e7%9f%a5%e4%ba%8b', '', '', '2024-12-18 16:04:25', '2024-12-18 08:04:25', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6453', 0, 'post', '', 0),
