(6463, 10, '2024-11-11 10:40:12', '2024-11-11 02:40:12', '今年首場高雄國際觀光推介會9月4日在韓國首爾盛大舉行，韓國台灣商會聯合總會<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">朱俊尹</span>會長受邀出席，<!--more-->另有超過百名來自韓國觀光旅遊業者代表，盼藉活動讓韓國重新認識高雄。\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/459042746_507741648568009_7542165871455936457_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_p526x395&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_eui2=AeGQflO2-w3QncknB7HWmTv2zBvhCsmR5FvMG-EKyZHkW7-QN5UQ0zW4vvVGh6gf9Sg&amp;_nc_ohc=N6OMZgVby-0Q7kNvgF5MpM4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=ASqkxD94UV2PI3DrRcvS7wf&amp;oh=00_AYDHlclrdcI8iLarJEbHR_Gqxj1HansR-RiG30MoO8O2GQ&amp;oe=67372293\" />', '韓總代表受邀參加高雄國際觀光推介會', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%9f%93%e7%b8%bd%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e5%8f%97%e9%82%80%e5%8f%83%e5%8a%a0%e9%ab%98%e9%9b%84%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e8%a7%80%e5%85%89%e6%8e%a8%e4%bb%8b%e6%9c%83', '', '', '2024-11-11 10:40:12', '2024-11-11 02:40:12', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6463', 0, 'post', '', 0),
