(6479, 10, '2024-11-11 10:48:31', '2024-11-11 02:48:31', '2024年9月7日澳門台商聯誼會舉辦「2024中秋Q作伙」活動，<!--more-->感謝天公伯賞臉，中秋前夕大家齊聚歡樂燒烤香味四溢，聯絡情誼，品嚐著香腸、甜不辣、黑輪、綠豆椪、麻豆文旦⋯⋯滿滿的台灣風味食品，活動圓滿落幕\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/461074209_517804590895048_204405925842157200_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_s600x600&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_eui2=AeFBM5otWg4YGuKJbnX8aqC_Jxzx02BzDEQnHPHTYHMMRPJPI_TEuss5f99WHN-iCF0&amp;_nc_ohc=r74ZY_1l7O4Q7kNvgEWHbdF&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AUBCKIsLSRc5RnawvktN9lL&amp;oh=00_AYA5FUt-mRSybRhNyOPojR4xS0_qiNEon-mpOftQ4VnJIw&amp;oe=673731F7\" />', '澳門台商聯誼會舉辦「2024中秋Q作伙」活動', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e8%81%af%e8%aa%bc%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e3%80%8c2024%e4%b8%ad%e7%a7%8bq%e4%bd%9c%e4%bc%99%e3%80%8d%e6%b4%bb%e5%8b%95', '', '', '2024-11-11 10:48:31', '2024-11-11 02:48:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6479', 0, 'post', '', 0),
