(6525, 10, '2024-12-18 16:17:55', '2024-12-18 08:17:55', '<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">總</span>本會<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">會長 林凱民 受邀前往參加北美洲台灣商會聯合總會</span> 第37屆第二次理監事聯席會議於11月10-13日在美國佛羅里達洲羅德岱堡隆重舉行，現場貴賓雲集。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6523\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/466992881_555087893833384_5158439922245431403_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6524\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/467116339_555087813833392_5697788080119964587_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '本會總會長林凱民受邀前往參加北美洲台灣商會聯合總會37-2理監事聯席會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6522-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-12-18 16:17:55', '2024-12-18 08:17:55', '', 6522, 'http://localhost/astcc/6522-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
