(6609, 10, '2025-03-12 14:10:09', '2025-03-12 06:10:09', '<div dir=\"auto\">越南臺灣商會聯合總會於2025年1月8日與國軍臺中總醫院簽訂健康檢查合作契約書，提供該會會員高品質、專業化的健康檢查服務，展現對海外越南臺商健康的關懷與支持。</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6610\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/472906396_592650656743774_8714779024338544659_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6611\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473293474_592650703410436_5894797793534339011_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6612\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473433317_592650696743770_2790133113639396119_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '越總與國軍臺中總醫院簽訂健康檢查合作契約書', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '6609-2', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:10:32', '2025-03-12 06:10:32', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6609', 0, 'post', '', 0),
