(6615, 10, '2025-03-12 14:11:50', '2025-03-12 06:11:50', '越南台商總會青商會於1月6日舉辦「越南青商會第八理監事會議、第九屆選舉與交接暨尾牙聯歡晚會」，由會長林洋逸及監事長張策連任，未來將繼續促進會員之間的合作與交流，引進更多創新的會務活動。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6616\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473164681_593823036626536_1590368808310672216_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6617\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473169729_593823039959869_6501821326344308857_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '越青舉辦交接晚會', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%b6%8a%e9%9d%92%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e4%ba%a4%e6%8e%a5%e6%99%9a%e6%9c%83', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:44:43', '2025-03-12 06:44:43', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6615', 0, 'post', '', 0),
