(6618, 10, '2025-03-12 14:11:50', '2025-03-12 06:11:50', '越南台商總會青商會於1月6日舉辦「越南青商會第八理監事會議、第九屆選舉與交接暨尾牙聯歡晚會」，由會長林洋逸及監事長張策連任，未來將繼續促進會員之間的合作與交流，引進更多創新的會務活動。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6616\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473164681_593823036626536_1590368808310672216_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6617\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473169729_593823039959869_6501821326344308857_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '越青舉辦交接晚會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6615-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:11:50', '2025-03-12 06:11:50', '', 6615, 'http://localhost/astcc/6615-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6619, 10, '2025-03-12 14:12:48', '2025-03-12 06:12:48', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">僑務委員會委員長徐佳青於1月11日拜會菲律賓臺商總會，由該總會總會長林登峰親自接待，交流當地臺商建議與期望，在融洽的氣氛中圓滿結束。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6620\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473326766_593825559959617_7245637532156995875_n-250x126.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '菲總接待僑委會委員長徐佳青', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '6619-2', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:13:23', '2025-03-12 06:13:23', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6619', 0, 'post', '', 0),
