(6636, 10, '2025-03-12 14:20:01', '2025-03-12 06:20:01', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第二日</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">帛琉新任正副總統就職典禮於16日舉行，此次外交部慶賀團共75人規模為各國之最，包含特使團及各行業代表組成的產業團，我方團員共24人包括總會長林凱民、世界台灣商會聯合總會名譽總會長李芳信、張南蘋名譽監事長、副總會長東鄉清龍、陳來埤、虞王利英、簡廷在、副秘書長林宇馨等多位理事，新竹市代理市長邱臣遠、新光人壽慈善基金會董事長吳欣盈亦應邀出席，向惠恕仁總統表達祝賀。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">典禮結束後，產業團成員赴Ngatpang港預定地聽取帛琉農業部長及技術團有關水產養殖的簡報。隨後前往帛琉國家醫院參加由林佳龍部長與惠恕仁總統 一同主持的「<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">帛琉國家醫院智慧醫療啟用儀式</span>」，在新光醫院院長侯勝茂的帶領下贈送醫療系統、儀器，藉以協助帛琉推動智慧醫療服務，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">當天行程最後參加了<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">總統就職典禮晚宴</span>，與國內外嘉賓享用當地美食及一同欣賞現場的傳統舞蹈，氣氛愉快。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6634\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474166152_598972682778238_2234423511929345143_n-250x186.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6635\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474210550_598972862778220_6489969277544259794_n-250x193.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表參加帛琉正副總統就職典禮', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6633-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:20:01', '2025-03-12 06:20:01', '', 6633, 'http://localhost/astcc/6633-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6637, 10, '2025-03-12 14:21:46', '2025-03-12 06:21:46', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第三日</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">17日上午惠恕仁總統親自向產業團團員進行 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">Malakal港區</span> 開發簡報及<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">保利馬氫氣船</span> 之說明。結束後，應惠總統之邀前往<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">洛克群島</span> 參訪海洋自然保育，體驗乘風破浪及南島海洋文化的熱情。午餐時間，惠總統偕林佳龍部長於無人島上與所有團員逐一拍照留念，充分展現友好情誼及對我團之高度重視。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">當晚全團出席<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">特使晚宴</span> ，惠總統及新任國會眾議長Gibson Kanai、國會議員、傳統領袖及全團共150人與宴，場面盛大。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6638\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474278622_599685082706998_7096663633238010423_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6639\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474454239_599685142706992_1282784995236362030_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表參訪海洋保育及特使晚宴', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e5%8f%83%e8%a8%aa%e6%b5%b7%e6%b4%8b%e4%bf%9d%e8%82%b2%e5%8f%8a%e7%89%b9%e4%bd%bf%e6%99%9a%e5%ae%b4', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:10:49', '2025-03-12 08:10:49', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6637', 0, 'post', '', 0),
