(6711, 10, '2025-03-12 14:57:28', '2025-03-12 06:57:28', '澳門台商聯誼會於2月22日應邀出席由台北經濟文化辦事處於澳門旅遊塔舉辦2025新春聯歡茶會，與澳門各界人士交流互動，活動中安排表演及抽獎，氣氛熱絡。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6714\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480850135_623475483661291_4892452294203720587_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6715\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481344412_623475443661295_9082110146528557562_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '澳門台商聯誼會出席台北經濟文化辦事處2025新春聯歡茶會', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e8%81%af%e8%aa%bc%e6%9c%83%e5%87%ba%e5%b8%ad%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e7%b6%93%e6%bf%9f%e6%96%87%e5%8c%96%e8%be%a6%e4%ba%8b%e8%99%952025%e6%96%b0%e6%98%a5%e8%81%af', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:57:28', '2025-03-12 06:57:28', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6711', 0, 'post', '', 0),
