(6732, 10, '2025-03-12 15:04:17', '2025-03-12 07:04:17', '本會總會長林凱民於2月27日與台北101 董事長賈永婕會面，<!--more-->討論舉辦結合台灣原住民及亞洲各國在台灣新住民的公益活動。此計劃將協助台灣原住民弱勢團體，並將一起關懷亞洲各國在台灣的新住民、僑生及旅台工作的各國國民，回饋當地社會\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6733\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480879604_625969623411877_5372969806695513231_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6734\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480990914_625969656745207_5280331936752637768_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6735\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481167074_625969633411876_6210988462947257171_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '本會總會長林凱民與台北101 董事長賈永婕會面', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%9c%ac%e6%9c%83%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7%e6%9e%97%e5%87%b1%e6%b0%91%e8%88%87%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97101-%e8%91%a3%e4%ba%8b%e9%95%b7%e8%b3%88%e6%b0%b8%e5%a9%95%e6%9c%83%e9%9d%a2', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:08:48', '2025-03-12 08:08:48', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6732', 0, 'post', '', 0),
