47\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/482984932_633186809356825_1031157603004977447_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '日總舉辦第12、13屆總會長、監事長政見發表暨投票選舉 及交接典禮', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6743-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:08:35', '2025-03-12 08:08:35', '', 6743, 'http://localhost/astcc/6743-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6753, 10, '2025-03-12 16:08:48', '2025-03-12 08:08:48', '本會總會長林凱民於2月27日與台北101 董事長賈永婕會面，<!--more-->討論舉辦結合台灣原住民及亞洲各國在台灣新住民的公益活動。此計劃將協助台灣原住民弱勢團體，並將一起關懷亞洲各國在台灣的新住民、僑生及旅台工作的各國國民，回饋當地社會\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6733\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480879604_625969623411877_5372969806695513231_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6734\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480990914_625969656745207_5280331936752637768_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6735\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481167074_625969633411876_6210988462947257171_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '本會總會長林凱民與台北101 董事長賈永婕會面', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6732-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:08:48', '2025-03-12 08:08:48', '', 6732, 'http://localhost/astcc/6732-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6754, 10, '2025-03-12 16:08:59', '2025-03-12 08:08:59', '越南臺灣商會聯合總會3月2日於胡志明市舉辦第26屆越南臺灣商會聯合總會第一次理監事暨會員代表大會，<!--more-->由總會長袁濟凡主持，來自越南各地的臺灣商會代表齊聚一堂，就未來商會發展、團隊培訓等議題展開熱烈討論，為新一屆理監事團隊的工作提供寶貴建議。會後並舉辦晚宴，氣氛熱絡，展現臺商團結與互助精神。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6750\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/482010948_630551072953732_7468479254487471804_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '越總舉辦第26屆第一次理監事暨會員代表大會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6749-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:08:59', '2025-03-12 08:08:59', '', 6749, 'http://localhost/astcc/6749-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6755, 10, '2025-03-12 16:09:11', '2025-03-12 08:09:11', '印尼台灣工商聯誼會聯合總會青商會於2月22日在雅加達PIK中餐廳舉辦春節晚宴暨會員歌唱比賽，<!--more-->該青商會會長賴仲威帶領小朋友表演舞蹈，現場笑聲不斷、喜氣洋洋。這場充滿美食、音樂與歡樂的夜晚，為新的一年揭開美好序幕，也讓每位來賓都帶著滿滿的幸福回憶而歸。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6721\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480698394_623177290357777_7822729234473353933_n-250x210.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6722\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481302501_623177293691110_4742365982557888943_n-250x210.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '印青舉辦春節晚宴暨會員歌唱比賽', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6720-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:09:11', '2025-03-12 08:09:11', '', 6720, 'http://localhost/astcc/6720-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6756, 10, '2025-03-12 16:09:46', '2025-03-12 08:09:46', '<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\">\r\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"html-div xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd\" data-ad-rendering-role=\"story_message\">\r\n<div id=\"«r8fr»\" class=\"x1l90r2v x1iorvi4 x1ye3gou xn6708d\" data-ad-comet-preview=\"message\" data-ad-preview=\"message\">\r\n<div class=\"x78zum5 xdt5ytf xz62fqu x16ldp7u\">\r\n<div class=\"xu06os2 x1ok221b\">\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">馬來西亞台灣商會聯合總會於2月22日召開第6次理監事會議，</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">由林凱民總會長主持、東馬區台灣商會承辦，林浩文會長與幹部團隊用心籌備，會議圓滿順利完成。在會議中，全國理事針對數項議案進行討論，並達成共識，進一步提升商會的運作。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"x168nmei x13lgxp2 x5pf9jr xo71vjh x1ey2m1c xds687c x5yr21d x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy xh8yej3 xl1xv1r\" src=\"https://scontent.fbkk6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/481121422_622882753720564_8218718951086104685_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_eui2=AeEo8FpfAFXIDlmGnx89MhLLCjUMxiZR9ZYKNQzGJlH1lgJz7SPPHzeFl8Gu-MFRQh8&amp;_nc_ohc=kG-eX128IU0Q7kNvgHNPpie&amp;_nc_oc=Adhz_fJbIeh_RHWlrU0L_rOjSJQuviIzV8Gztm1IRWRuLX90SCSIZa5deWJD6rmKHEw&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk6-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AHzxgeWyoAPVqT2UcNZNPSg&amp;oh=00_AYGxA8sdg96Bzk-r1oMX6f2snB-uGnszhmXcSPO_Ai6mQQ&amp;oe=67D701ED\" alt=\"May be an image of 7 people\" width=\"1440\" height=\"488\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div class=\"x8gbvx8 x80vd3b x1q0q8m5 xso031l x8cjs6t x13fuv20 x178xt8z x78zum5 x1q0g3np x1qughib xz9dl7a xn6708d xsag5q8 xpkgp8e\">\r\n<div class=\"x78zum5 x1q0g3np\">\r\n<div class=\"x12mruv9 x1xmf6yo x1sxyh0\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '馬總召開第17屆第6次理監事會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6709-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:09:46', '2025-03-12 08:09:46', '', 6709, 'http://localhost/astcc/6709-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6757, 10, '2025-03-12 16:10:01', '2025-03-12 08:10:01', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">印尼台灣工商聯誼會聯合總會長王銘聰率領各印尼台商分會理事長與秘書長於2月18日拜會駐印尼台北經濟貿易代表處，與洪振榮大使及相關部會長官進行交流。會中，各分會代表針對會員需求提出意見，並與駐處官員就經貿合作、投資環境及政策支持等議題進行深入討論。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">會後，進行新春團拜晚宴。此次活動不僅促進了台商與駐印尼代表處的聯繫，也加強了台商社群的凝聚力，為未來的合作發展奠定了良好基礎。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6706\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480424011_620801960595310_3421437173371403835_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6707\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480539600_620801957261977_4603578916385042505_n-250x113.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '印總拜會駐印尼台北經濟貿易代表處暨新春團拜晚宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6705-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:10:01', '2025-03-12 08:10:01', '', 6705, 'http://localhost/astcc/6705-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6758, 10, '2025-03-12 16:10:31', '2025-03-12 08:10:31', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">18日上午，外交部帛琉總統就職典禮慶賀團赴艾來州傳統男人會館進行文化參訪，深入體驗當地傳統舞蹈並了解戰船文化。中午，帛琉台商會會長李志偉設宴招待團員，多位當地台商出席與團員交流；本會總會長林凱民在致辭後，特別向林佳龍部長及駐帛黎倩儀大使贈送紀念品，以感謝他們對此次行程的規劃與協助。餐後，團員們實地考察了三家由台商投資經營的飯店：Papago Resort、帛琉大飯店PALASIA HOTEL PALAU及月伴灣飯店Palau Landmark Marina，了解當地旅遊飯店產業，探索投資商機。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">最後在享用點心及稍作休息後前往機場返台，帛琉國務部部長 Gustav Aitaro及帛琉駐台大使歐儒侃（David Adams Orrukem）親自前來送機，展現對於此團的重視與友好。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">此行圓滿完成，為我國「榮邦計畫」在帛琉邁出堅實步伐，並為協助打造帛琉成為「智慧永續島嶼」奠定了良好基礎。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6642\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474204447_599943402681166_477448214976245757_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6643\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474516759_599943036014536_6697599893779615266_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6644\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474564372_599942789347894_128834541269618668_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表團進行帛琉文化參訪及考察飯店旅遊業', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6641-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:10:31', '2025-03-12 08:10:31', '', 6641, 'http://localhost/astcc/6641-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6762, 10, '2025-04-21 10:41:34', '2025-04-21 02:41:34', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">2025中華民國全國商業總會新春聯誼晚宴4日晚間在台北茹曦酒店盛大登場，由商總理事長許舒博主辦。本會總會長林凱民受邀參加，現場貴賓雲集，許多國家的僑臺商也出席，與商總理監事、會員代表們共襄盛舉。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6763\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488406400_652413437434162_8288452404571899751_n-250x97.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總代表參加2025中華民國全國商業總會新春聯誼晚宴', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e5%8f%83%e5%8a%a02025%e4%b8%ad%e8%8f%af%e6%b0%91%e5%9c%8b%e5%85%a8%e5%9c%8b%e5%95%86%e6%a5%ad%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e6%96%b0%e6%98%a5%e8%81%af%e8%aa%bc%e6%99%9a', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:41:51', '2025-04-21 02:41:51', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6762', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(6763, 10, '2025-04-21 10:41:13', '2025-04-21 02:41:13', '', '488406400_652413437434162_8288452404571899751_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '488406400_652413437434162_8288452404571899751_n', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:41:13', '2025-04-21 02:41:13', '', 6762, 'http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488406400_652413437434162_8288452404571899751_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6764, 10, '2025-04-21 10:41:34', '2025-04-21 02:41:34', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">2025中華民國全國商業總會新春聯誼晚宴4日晚間在台北茹曦酒店盛大登場，由商總理事長許舒博主辦。本會總會長林凱民受邀參加，現場貴賓雲集，許多國家的僑臺商也出席，與商總理監事、會員代表們共襄盛舉。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6763\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488406400_652413437434162_8288452404571899751_n-250x97.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總代表參加2025中華民國全國商業總會新春聯誼晚宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6762-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:41:34', '2025-04-21 02:41:34', '', 6762, 'http://localhost/astcc/6762-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6765, 10, '2025-04-21 10:43:13', '2025-04-21 02:43:13', '本會總會長林凱民於3月6日參訪位於苗栗縣竹南鎮的群聯電子並與該公司董事長潘健成面談，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n邀請在今年7月亞總年會的論壇分享最新的AI技術及未來走勢。此次交流不僅為年會內容規劃提供了寶貴的參考，也進一步促進了學界與產業界在前沿技術領域的合作與對話。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6766\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488450875_652410720767767_3450023075247121457_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總拜訪群聯電子董事長潘健成', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e6%8b%9c%e8%a8%aa%e7%be%a4%e8%81%af%e9%9b%bb%e5%ad%90%e8%91%a3%e4%ba%8b%e9%95%b7%e6%bd%98%e5%81%a5%e6%88%90', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:43:13', '2025-04-21 02:43:13', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6765', 0, 'post', '', 0),
