(6789, 10, '2025-04-21 10:59:45', '2025-04-21 02:59:45', '柬埔寨臺商協會於3月8日舉辦新春團拜活動，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n由會長陳來埤主持，除了團拜活動外，還安排在場嘉賓上臺盡展歌喉，為大家帶來娛樂和放鬆的時刻，現場充滿歡樂與活力，也為活動畫下圓滿的句點。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6790\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/490351389_658669543475218_8577610880800195966_n-250x169.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6791\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/490951034_658667293475443_4381974290555607326_n-250x165.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '柬埔寨臺商協會舉辦新春團拜', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%9f%ac%e5%9f%94%e5%af%a8%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e6%96%b0%e6%98%a5%e5%9c%98%e6%8b%9c', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:59:45', '2025-04-21 02:59:45', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6789', 0, 'post', '', 0),
