(6793, 10, '2025-04-21 11:03:05', '2025-04-21 03:03:05', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">世界台灣商會聯合總會於3月22日隆重舉辦開幕典禮及第31屆第2次理監事聯席會議，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">由總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">吳光宜</span>主持。會議中，本會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span>及各洲的洲總會長報告了會務進展，並針對重要議題進行深入探討。會後，與會者參加僑委會晚宴，委員長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">徐佳青</span>親臨現場，氣氛熱絡。會議後的隔日，大會招待休士頓太空科技/自然科技一日遊，與會者深入了解當地文化與風光。當晚並共度充滿歡樂的“休士頓之夜”，讓大家在輕鬆愉快的氛圍中加深友誼與合作關係。此次活動不僅增強了商會的凝聚力，也提供了寶貴的交流平台。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6794\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486279785_644714591537380_4508241185711226_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6795\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486318961_644714474870725_2950259230824908310_n-250x133.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6796\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486774093_644714631537376_6633941557785096207_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6797\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486861631_644714574870715_1244877166240494707_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6798\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/487040433_644714458204060_4680408948507381742_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總代表參加室總31-2理監事聯席會議', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e5%8f%83%e5%8a%a0%e5%ae%a4%e7%b8%bd31-2%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e8%81%af%e5%b8%ad%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:03:05', '2025-04-21 03:03:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6793', 0, 'post', '', 0),
