(6804, 10, '2025-04-21 11:05:10', '2025-04-21 03:05:10', '孟加拉台灣商會於3月14日舉辦第八屆、第九屆會長交接暨會員大會，\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n本會輔導總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">許玉林</span>偕同多位理事前往參加盛會，祝福該會會務興隆。並於會後參加孟加拉首都達卡一日遊，體驗當地生活人文。<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6801\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486466923_644354431573396_3864757382453130890_n-250x112.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6802\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486559818_644354454906727_6831867640411700339_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6803\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486602134_644354341573405_6004922215909749834_n-250x112.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '孟加拉台灣商會第八屆、第九屆會長交接暨會員大會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6800-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:05:10', '2025-04-21 03:05:10', '', 6800, 'http://localhost/astcc/6800-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6805, 10, '2025-04-21 11:06:55', '2025-04-21 03:06:55', '韓國台灣商會總會於3月15日召開今年度第一次理監事會議，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n並於會中由該會會長朱俊尹與韓國大學院聯盟總裁金潤泰簽署合作交流協議，盼促進產學人才交流。也希望更多有意至韓國發展的台灣年輕人可以透過此平台在韓國獲得更好的職涯發展。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6806\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/491013860_659490186726487_480513922651669214_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '韓國台灣商會總會召開理監事會議', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e5%8f%ac%e9%96%8b%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:06:55', '2025-04-21 03:06:55', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6805', 0, 'post', '', 0),
