(6876, 10, '2025-07-31 14:20:28', '2025-07-31 06:20:28', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">日本關西台商會青商會於5月10日在京都，舉辦「2025第二回台商劍道鍊成大會」。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">在明治32年（1899年）落成、歷史悠久的劍道殿堂中，來自日本各地的台僑夥伴齊聚一堂。透過劍道競技及精神，深度交流；重新認識自己，也重新連結彼此。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6874\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499975064_684816277527211_3935252996328967908_n-250x147.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6875\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499568953_684816304193875_4506003695379381111_n-250x148.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>', '日本關西台商會青商會舉辦「2025第二回台商劍道鍊成大會」', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6873-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:20:28', '2025-07-31 06:20:28', '', 6873, 'http://localhost/astcc/6873-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6877, 10, '2025-07-31 14:22:11', '2025-07-31 06:22:11', '<div dir=\"auto\">本會總會長林凱民於5月11日親赴泰國祝賀泰國台灣商會聯合總會總會長陳漢川榮膺連任第17屆總會長，並致贈紀念品，期盼該會會務蒸蒸日上、蓬勃發展。</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6878\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499963896_686027180739454_6771833704259803804_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '本會總會長林凱民赴泰國祝賀泰總陳漢川榮膺連任第17屆總會長', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%9c%ac%e6%9c%83%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7%e6%9e%97%e5%87%b1%e6%b0%91%e8%b5%b4%e6%b3%b0%e5%9c%8b%e7%a5%9d%e8%b3%80%e6%b3%b0%e7%b8%bd%e9%99%b3%e6%bc%a2%e5%b7%9d%e6%a6%ae%e8%86%ba%e9%80%a3%e4%bb%bb', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:22:11', '2025-07-31 06:22:11', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6877', 0, 'post', '', 0),
