(6897, 10, '2025-07-31 14:33:00', '2025-07-31 06:33:00', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">香港台灣工商協會劉孝超會長率團於5月19日拜會新竹市政府，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n代理市長邱臣遠率市府團隊盛情接待，期待雙方更進一步的交流與合作，並吸引外資投資新竹市，共同促進城市發展，強化經濟成長效益並提升企業競爭力。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6896\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500105747_686094680732704_5949044140258384922_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>', '香港台灣工商協會拜會新竹市政府', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6895-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:33:00', '2025-07-31 06:33:00', '', 6895, 'http://localhost/astcc/6895-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6898, 10, '2025-07-31 14:34:46', '2025-07-31 06:34:46', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">泰國臺灣商會聯合總會第33週年慶暨總會長連任典禮及青商會會長交接典禮，於5月17日隆重舉行。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本會監事長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">吳國本</span>應邀出席，觀禮總會長陳漢川及監事長章維斌榮膺連任，同時也見證青商會第7屆會長許家瑋與第8屆會長黃啟碩之交接儀式。此次盛會展現出泰國臺商的團結一心，期盼總會未來持續推動創新與互惠，攜手共創榮景。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6885\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500063313_687579597250879_3429370375447979496_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6886\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499940929_687579657250873_6774623172360011401_n-250x205.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6887\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499779391_687579660584206_1469663123010750544_n-250x210.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>', '泰總交接典禮', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6884-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:34:46', '2025-07-31 06:34:46', '', 6884, 'http://localhost/astcc/6884-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6899, 10, '2025-07-31 14:36:36', '2025-07-31 06:36:36', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">賴清德總統於5月20日晚間偕同蕭美琴副總統，在總統府以國宴宴請帛琉共和國總統惠恕仁（Surangel S. Whipps, Jr.）伉儷及訪團貴賓，盼持續促進兩國觀光交流及體育合作。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本會總會長林凱民曾兩度率團友好拜訪帛琉，亦受邀出席此盛會，攜手推動兩國在經貿與觀光方面的合作。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6900\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499989675_687618707246968_8949434757190002251_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6901\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500046153_687618703913635_8379960438604264720_n-250x166.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6902\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500225257_687618757246963_1936682617079276572_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '林凱民總會長受邀參加國宴', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%9e%97%e5%87%b1%e6%b0%91%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7%e5%8f%97%e9%82%80%e5%8f%83%e5%8a%a0%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%b4', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:36:36', '2025-07-31 06:36:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6899', 0, 'post', '', 0),
