(6910, 10, '2025-07-31 14:40:24', '2025-07-31 06:40:24', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">柬埔寨台商協會於5月24日晚間舉辦「第十五屆第二次會員大會暨端午節晚宴」，由該會會長陳來埤主持，吸引了眾多會員和嘉賓齊聚一堂，共同慶祝這一傳統佳節。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6908\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500718754_690307643644741_6112440210989010168_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6909\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500627750_690307646978074_5278406224335607664_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '柬埔寨台商協會舉辦「第十五屆第二次會員大會暨端午節晚宴」', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6907-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:40:24', '2025-07-31 06:40:24', '', 6907, 'http://localhost/astcc/6907-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6911, 10, '2025-07-31 14:42:29', '2025-07-31 06:42:29', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲孟加拉、越南台商代表24日赴印度班加羅爾考察，先後參訪台灣電子大廠及中小企業，25日再以球會友，於台灣盃高球賽與日本、韓國企業代表交流，期盼能獲得更多投資訊息。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><!--more--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6912\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500225777_690110473664458_432133093464545968_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6913\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500759236_690110470331125_4582978877780102128_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞洲孟加拉、越南台商代表赴印度班加羅爾考察', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2%e5%ad%9f%e5%8a%a0%e6%8b%89%e3%80%81%e8%b6%8a%e5%8d%97%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e8%b5%b4%e5%8d%b0%e5%ba%a6%e7%8f%ad%e5%8a%a0%e7%be%85%e7%88%be%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:42:29', '2025-07-31 06:42:29', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6911', 0, 'post', '', 0),
