(6941, 10, '2025-07-31 14:58:57', '2025-07-31 06:58:57', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">香港台灣工商協會於4月16日舉辦《參訪香港航空訓練大樓》活動，安排會員進行半日體驗，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n深入了解空服員的培訓過程，學習如何應對航班上的突發狀況，並親身體驗機師模擬駕駛飛機的訓練課程。透過此次活動，讓參與者對航空業幕後的專業訓練有更深刻的認識與體驗。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6940\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/506349533_701226879219484_4854488940852698567_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>', '香港台灣工商協會舉辦《參訪香港航空訓練大樓》', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6939-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:58:57', '2025-07-31 06:58:57', '', 6939, 'http://localhost/astcc/6939-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6942, 10, '2025-07-31 15:00:30', '2025-07-31 07:00:30', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">越南台灣商會聯合總會青商會於5月31日舉辦「端午包粽趣」，由越總名譽總會長廖育珠傳授獨門肉粽配方並教導包粽子絕竅，粽葉飄香，所有與會者共度溫馨愉快的端午節。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6943\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/503962901_696184246390414_7668937006803450650_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '越青舉辦端午包粽趣」', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%b6%8a%e9%9d%92%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e7%ab%af%e5%8d%88%e5%8c%85%e7%b2%bd%e8%b6%a3%e3%80%8d', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:00:30', '2025-07-31 07:00:30', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6942', 0, 'post', '', 0),
