(6995, 10, '2025-07-31 15:25:31', '2025-07-31 07:25:31', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲台灣商會聯合總會長林凱民今(9)日率團拜會新竹市政府，由代理市長邱臣遠接待，與來自馬來西亞、越南、日本、柬埔寨、菲律賓、印尼、新加坡等地的僑台商代表，就全球供應鏈變局、科技產業佈局與美中貿易衝擊進行深度交流。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6993\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/518273831_722916723717166_192634319674762464_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6994\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/516772099_722916720383833_9111160047467028896_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞總32拜會新竹市政府', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6992-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:25:31', '2025-07-31 07:25:31', '', 6992, 'http://localhost/astcc/6992-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6996, 10, '2025-07-31 15:26:50', '2025-07-31 07:26:50', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">日本臺灣商會聯合總會7月6日在橫濱召開第13屆第2次理監事會議及講座，來自全日本各地的理監事及僑會代表齊聚一堂，就日總未來會務發展深入討論，展現高度凝聚力與執行力。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6997\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/516959492_723884513620387_7751220504502119014_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '日總舉辦第13屆第2次理監事會議及講座', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%97%a5%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e7%ac%ac13%e5%b1%86%e7%ac%ac2%e6%ac%a1%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0%e5%8f%8a%e8%ac%9b%e5%ba%a7', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:26:50', '2025-07-31 07:26:50', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6996', 0, 'post', '', 0),
