(6998, 10, '2025-07-31 15:26:50', '2025-07-31 07:26:50', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">日本臺灣商會聯合總會7月6日在橫濱召開第13屆第2次理監事會議及講座，來自全日本各地的理監事及僑會代表齊聚一堂，就日總未來會務發展深入討論，展現高度凝聚力與執行力。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6997\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/516959492_723884513620387_7751220504502119014_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '日總舉辦第13屆第2次理監事會議及講座', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6996-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:26:50', '2025-07-31 07:26:50', '', 6996, 'http://localhost/astcc/6996-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6999, 10, '2025-07-31 15:28:39', '2025-07-31 07:28:39', '泰國台灣商會聯合總會青商會多位幹部代表隨同台灣駐泰代表處董思齊公使於7月8、9日走訪清萊及清邁共八所華校。<!--more-->盼藉此促進青年僑商與教育界的鏈結，資源媒合，透過企業資源投入教育，帶動地方發展。除學校訪視外，亦緬懷忠烈、回顧歷史，深化對僑胞奮鬥史與族群認同的理解\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7000\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/517052454_723892250286280_6245231359258464444_n-250x146.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7001\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/518359734_723892243619614_6853881176046440891_n-250x156.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7002\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/516626078_723892253619613_1545460919986498137_n-250x175.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '泰青隨駐泰代表處走訪泰北八所華校', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%b3%b0%e9%9d%92%e9%9a%a8%e9%a7%90%e6%b3%b0%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e8%99%95%e8%b5%b0%e8%a8%aa%e6%b3%b0%e5%8c%97%e5%85%ab%e6%89%80%e8%8f%af%e6%a0%a1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:28:39', '2025-07-31 07:28:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=6999', 0, 'post', '', 0),
