up9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcf/2/16/1faa8.png\" alt=\"🪨\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第四站｜和平島地質公園探奇</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">走訪2300萬年前海底火山活動遺留的奇岩怪石，探索台灣東北角珍貴的地質資產。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8a/2/16/1f377.png\" alt=\"🍷\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第五站｜天顯宮晚宴</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第32屆監事長吳國本於天顯宮設宴，款待來自亞總成員，美食佳餚，為一日遊畫下溫馨完美句點。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7012\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520223307_732453409430164_424546354081074058_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7013\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/518340416_732453822763456_9169120379322529196_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7014\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520170263_732453459430159_734318681730277369_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞總32-3【會前基隆港一日遊】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7011-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:40:13', '2025-07-31 07:40:13', '', 7011, 'http://localhost/astcc/7011-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(7016, 10, '2025-07-31 15:41:36', '2025-07-31 07:41:36', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總32-3【會前高爾夫球敘】</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">7月15日於國華高爾夫球場舉辦會前高爾夫球賽，吸引來自各國近60多位球友熱情參與。在揮桿之間增進交流、凝聚情誼，在競技與歡笑中度過美好時光，展現亞總團結互助、熱情洋溢的精神。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7017\" src=\"http://localhost/astcc/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520288773_732464939429011_3756411627088147844_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總32-3【會前高爾夫球敘】', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd32-3%e3%80%90%e6%9c%83%e5%89%8d%e9%ab%98%e7%88%be%e5%a4%ab%e7%90%83%e6%95%98%e3%80%91', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:42:56', '2025-07-31 07:42:56', '', 0, 'http://localhost/astcc/?p=7016', 0, 'post', '', 0),
